  ('芽', '芽', '["bud","sprout","spear","germ"]'::jsonb, '{"ガ"}', '{"め"}', 'N2', 4, 8, '82bd', 'Phono-semantic: plants (艹) + 牙 ''tusk'' (phonetic ガ) — the shoot breaking soil like a tusk: a bud.', 'Spring''s first fang — め. 芽が出る: talent and tulips, same verb.'),
  ('賀', '賀', '["congratulations","joy"]'::jsonb, '{"ガ"}', '{}', 'N2', 4, 12, '8cc0', 'Phono-semantic: 加 (phonetic ガ) + 貝 — gifts added to good news: felicitation.', 'Joy plus an envelope of cash — ガ. 年賀状: congratulations, postmarked January 1st.'),
