  ('潟', '潟', '["lagoon"]'::jsonb, '{"セキ"}', '{"かた","-がた"}', 'N2', 4, 15, '6f5f', 'Phono-semantic: water (氵) + 舄 (phonetic セキ) — shallow tidal flats: a lagoon.', 'Water that can''t decide if it''s land — かた. 新潟: the new lagoon, now a prefecture.'),
