  ('挙', '挙', '["raise","plan","project","behavior","actions"]'::jsonb, '{"キョ"}', '{"あ.げる","あ.がる","こぞ.る"}', 'N2', 4, 10, '6319', 'Simplified from 擧: many hands lifting together — to raise up, cite, hold (an event).', 'Hands up, all at once — あげる. 選挙: raising hands nationally.'),
