  ('郡', '郡', '["county","district"]'::jsonb, '{"グン"}', '{"こおり"}', 'N2', 4, 10, '90e1', 'Phono-semantic: 君 (phonetic グン) + city (阝) — the lord''s administrative district: a county.', 'The lord''s slice of the map — グン. Rural addresses still carry it.'),
