  ('徳', '徳', '["benevolence","virtue","goodness","commanding respect"]'::jsonb, '{"トク"}', '{}', 'N2', 4, 14, '5fb3', 'Compound: walking (彳) with a straight-seen heart (直+心) — conduct upright at every step: virtue.', 'Ten eyes watch the heart walk: it stays straight anyway — トク. 徳島: virtue with a bridge.'),
