  ('梅', '梅', '["plum"]'::jsonb, '{"バイ"}', '{"うめ"}', 'N2', 4, 10, '6885', 'Phono-semantic: tree (木) + 毎 (phonetic バイ) — the tree that blooms first every year: the plum.', 'Every (毎) spring''s opening act — うめ. 梅雨: the plum rains of June.'),
  ('博', '博', '["Dr.","command","esteem","win acclaim","Ph.D.","exposition","fair"]'::jsonb, '{"ハク","バク"}', '{}', 'N2', 4, 12, '535a', 'Phono-semantic: 十 ''complete'' + 尃 (phonetic ハク) — learning spread wide: extensive; the extensively learned: doctor.', 'Ten specialties and one extra dot of genius — ハク. 博物館: the doctor''s attic, public.'),
