  ('票', '票', '["ballot","label","ticket","sign"]'::jsonb, '{"ヒョウ"}', '{}', 'N2', 4, 11, '7968', 'Originally sparks flying up — light slips of paper drifting: tickets, ballots.', 'Paper slips rising like sparks from the ballot box — ヒョウ. 投票: casting your spark.'),
  ('牧', '牧', '["breed","care for","shepherd","feed","pasture"]'::jsonb, '{"ボク"}', '{"まき"}', 'N2', 4, 8, '7267', 'Compound ideograph: cattle (牛) driven with the stick (攵) — herding: to pasture, raise.', 'The herder''s tap on the flank — まき. 牧場: the office of cows.'),
