  ('梨', '梨', '["pear tree"]'::jsonb, '{"リ"}', '{"なし"}', 'N2', 4, 11, '68a8', 'Phono-semantic: 利 (phonetic リ) + tree (木) — the orchard''s crisp profit: the pear.', 'The tree whose fruit pays (利) — なし. 山梨: pear-mountain, grape country ironically.'),
