  ('栃', '栃', '["horse chestnut","(kokuji)"]'::jsonb, '{}', '{"とち"}', 'N1', 4, 9, '6803', 'A kokuji — made in Japan: the tochi tree: horse chestnut; Tochigi''s namesake.', 'The tree Japan had to invent a kanji for — とち. 栃木: chestnut-tree prefecture.'),
  ('阜', '阜', '["hill","mound","left village radical (no. 170)"]'::jsonb, '{"フ","フウ"}', '{}', 'N1', 4, 8, '961c', 'Pictograph: the terraced mound — the left-side 阝''s full form; Gifu''s second kanji.', 'The 阝 radical, standing alone at last — フ. 岐阜: fork-hill.'),
  ('質', '質', '["substance","quality","matter","temperament"]'::jsonb, '{"シツ","シチ","チ"}', '{"たち","ただ.す","もと","わりふ"}', 'N4', 5, 15, '8cea', 'Compound: two axes (斤斤) over money (貝) — goods pledged against a loan, weighed at their true worth: substance, quality; a question probing that worth (質問).', 'The pawnbroker sets two axes on the counter and weighs your treasure''s real worth — シツ. 質問 does the same to a claim: ''what''s underneath?'''),
  ('貸', '貸', '["lend"]'::jsonb, '{"タイ"}', '{"か.す","か.し-","かし-"}', 'N4', 5, 12, '8cb8', 'Phono-semantic: 代 ''substitute'' (phonetic タイ) + money (貝) — money handed over in place of trust: to lend.', 'Your cash steps in as a substitute (代) in someone else''s pocket — かす. The pair to remember: 貸す lends out, 借りる borrows in.'),
  ('堂', '堂', '["public chamber","hall"]'::jsonb, '{"ドウ"}', '{}', 'N4', 5, 11, '5802', 'Phono-semantic: 尚 ''lofty, esteemed'' (phonetic ドウ) + earth (土) — a raised earthen platform for assembly: the hall.', 'A packed dirt stage with a proud roof: the town''s gathering hall — ドウ. 食堂 is the hall that smells best.'),
  ('圧', '圧', '["pressure","push","overwhelm","oppress","dominate"]'::jsonb, '{"アツ","エン","オウ"}', '{"お.す","へ.す","おさ.える","お.さえる"}', 'N3', 5, 5, '5727', 'Simplified from 壓: the cliff''s mass (厂) bearing down on the earth (土) — crushing weight: pressure.', 'The whole cliff resting on one patch of ground — アツ. 気圧 is the sky doing it; プレッシャー the boss''s version.'),
  ('囲', '囲', '["surround","besiege","store","paling","enclosure","encircle","preserve","keep"]'::jsonb, '{"イ"}', '{"かこ.む","かこ.う","かこ.い"}', 'N3', 5, 7, '56f2', 'Phono-semantic (simplified from 圍): enclosure (囗) + 井 (phonetic イ) — walls drawn around: to surround.', 'The village well with a fence on all four sides — かこむ. 周囲: everything inside your fence-line of attention.'),
  ('易', '易', '["easy","ready to","simple","fortune-telling","divination"]'::jsonb, '{"エキ","イ"}', '{"やさ.しい","やす.い"}', 'N3', 5, 8, '6613', 'Pictograph read as a lizard that changes color — change (the 易 of the I Ching); what changes without resistance: easy.', 'The lizard switches colors without effort — やさしい, エキ. 貿易 is nations doing the color-swap; 簡単より易しい.'),
  ('移', '移', '["shift","move","change","drift","catch (cold, fire)","pass into"]'::jsonb, '{"イ"}', '{"うつ.る","うつ.す"}', 'N3', 5, 11, '79fb', 'Phono-semantic: grain (禾) + 多 (phonetic イ) — seedlings transplanted bed to bed: to shift, transfer.', 'Rice moved seedling by seedling to the big paddy — うつる. 移動: the transplant, applied to yourself.'),
  ('因', '因', '["cause","factor","be associated with","depend on","be limited to"]'::jsonb, '{"イン"}', '{"よ.る","ちな.む"}', 'N3', 5, 6, '56e0', 'Compound ideograph: a person (大) lying on the mat (囗) that supports them — the thing an outcome rests on: cause, basis.', 'Whatever you find under the result when you lift it — イン. 原因: the mat the accident was lying on.'),
  ('営', '営', '["camp","perform","build","conduct (business)"]'::jsonb, '{"エイ"}', '{"いとな.む","いとな.み"}', 'N3', 5, 12, '55b6', 'Simplified from 營: watchfires over connected quarters (呂) — the laid-out camp; to run its operations: to operate, manage.', 'Lamps burning over both offices — えいぎょう中. 営業: the fires are lit, come in.'),
  ('永', '永', '["eternity","long","lengthy"]'::jsonb, '{"エイ"}', '{"なが.い"}', 'N3', 5, 5, '6c38', 'Pictograph: a river shown with its long branching course — water that runs on and on: eternal.', 'One drop more than 水: enough to run forever — ながい, エイ. 永遠: the river with no last bend.'),
  ('液', '液', '["fluid","liquid","juice","sap","secretion"]'::jsonb, '{"エキ"}', '{}', 'N3', 5, 11, '6db2', 'Phono-semantic: water (氵) + 夜 (phonetic エキ) — flowing substance: liquid, fluid.', 'Water that works the night shift in your body — エキ. 血液: the busiest fluid on the payroll.'),
  ('演', '演', '["performance","act","play","render","stage"]'::jsonb, '{"エン"}', '{}', 'N3', 5, 14, '6f14', 'Phono-semantic: water (氵) + 寅 (phonetic エン) — water drawn out long: to extend, unfold; to unfold before an audience: to perform.', 'Let the idea flow out at full length under the lights — エン. 演説 unfolds words; 演技 unfolds a role.'),
  ('応', '応', '["apply","answer","yes","OK","reply","accept"]'::jsonb, '{"オウ","ヨウ","-ノウ"}', '{"あた.る","まさに","こた.える"}', 'N3', 5, 7, '5fdc', 'Simplified from 應: a heart (心) under the eaves — the heart answering what arrives: to respond, comply, apply.', 'Knock, and the heart under the roof answers — オウ. 応援 is answering with noise; 反応 answering by reflex.'),
  ('仮', '仮', '["sham","temporary","interim","assumed (name)","informal"]'::jsonb, '{"カ","ケ"}', '{"かり","かり-"}', 'N3', 5, 6, '4eee', 'Phono-semantic (simplified from 假): person (亻) + 反 (phonetic カ) — a stand-in flipped into place: temporary, assumed.', 'Someone playing the part until the real one arrives — かり. 仮名: the ''borrowed names'' that became hiragana.'),
  ('価', '価', '["value","price"]'::jsonb, '{"カ","ケ"}', '{"あたい"}', 'N3', 5, 8, '4fa1', 'Phono-semantic (simplified from 價): person (亻) + 賈 ''merchant'' — what the merchant says it''s worth: price, value.', 'The stallholder squints at it and names a number — カ. 価格 is that number in print; 価値 what it''s actually worth.'),
  ('可', '可', '["can","passable","approval"]'::jsonb, '{"カ","コク"}', '{"-べ.き","-べ.し"}', 'N3', 5, 5, '53ef', 'Compound: a mouth (口) with breath forced out crooked — the grunt of approval: permitted, possible.', 'The examiner''s single grunt: passable — カ. 可能 opens doors; 不可 slams this same kanji shut.'),
  ('河', '河', '["river"]'::jsonb, '{"カ"}', '{"かわ"}', 'N3', 5, 8, '6cb3', 'Phono-semantic: water (氵) + 可 (phonetic カ) — originally the proper name of the Yellow River; then any great river.', 'The river so big it was just called The River — かわ. 銀河: the night sky''s own 河.'),
  ('過', '過', '["overdo","exceed","go beyond","error"]'::jsonb, '{"カ"}', '{"す.ぎる","す.ごす","あやま.ち","あやま.つ","よぎ.る","よ.ぎる"}', 'N3', 5, 12, '904e', 'Phono-semantic: movement (辶) + 咼 (phonetic カ) — going past the mark: to pass, to exceed; going too far: an error.', 'You were supposed to stop back there — すぎる. 食べ過ぎ, 働き過ぎ: the kanji of one step too many; 過去 is everything already passed.'),
  ('解', '解', '["unravel","notes","key","explanation","understanding","untie","undo","solve","answer","cancel","absolve","explain","minute"]'::jsonb, '{"カイ","ゲ"}', '{"と.く","と.かす","と.ける","ほど.く","ほぐ.す","わか.る","さと.る"}', 'N3', 5, 13, '89e3', 'Compound ideograph: a blade (刀) parting the horn (角) from the ox (牛) — taking apart at the joints: to dissolve, to solve, to understand.', 'The butcher never forces: he finds where things already separate — とく, わかる. 解決 is doing that to a problem.'),
  ('快', '快', '["cheerful","pleasant","agreeable","comfortable"]'::jsonb, '{"カイ"}', '{"こころよ.い"}', 'N3', 5, 7, '5feb', 'Phono-semantic: heart (忄) + 夬 ''burst open'' (phonetic カイ) — the heart''s dam breaking into relief: pleasant, brisk.', 'The blockage in the chest gives way: sudden clear water — こころよい. 快晴 is the sky''s version of the feeling.'),
  ('格', '格', '["status","rank","capacity","character","case (law, grammar)"]'::jsonb, '{"カク","コウ","キャク","ゴウ"}', '{}', 'N3', 5, 10, '683c', 'Phono-semantic: wood (木) + 各 (phonetic カク) — the squared frame each piece must fit: the standard; where you fit it: status.', 'The lattice every beam is measured against — カク. 合格: you fit the frame; 性格: the frame you were born with.'),
  ('確', '確', '["assurance","firm","tight","hard","solid","confirm","clear","evident"]'::jsonb, '{"カク","コウ"}', '{"たし.か","たし.かめる"}', 'N3', 5, 15, '78ba', 'Phono-semantic: stone (石) + 隺 (phonetic カク) — solid as bedrock: certain, definite.', 'Tap it: stone all the way through — たしか. 確認 is tapping twice to be sure.'),
  ('額', '額', '["forehead","tablet","plaque","framed picture","sum","amount","volume"]'::jsonb, '{"ガク"}', '{"ひたい"}', 'N3', 5, 18, '984d', 'Phono-semantic: 客 (phonetic ガク) + head (頁) — the head''s front: forehead; the plaque hung at that height: a framed sum, an amount.', 'The number on the plaque at eye level — ひたい for the brow, ガク for the bill. 金額: the forehead of an invoice.'),
  ('刊', '刊', '["publish","carve","engrave"]'::jsonb, '{"カン"}', '{}', 'N3', 5, 5, '520a', 'Phono-semantic: 干 (phonetic カン) + blade (刂) — carving the printing blocks: to publish.', 'The knife cuts today''s edition into the wood — カン. 朝刊: last night''s carving on your doormat.'),
  ('慣', '慣', '["accustomed","get used to","become experienced"]'::jsonb, '{"カン"}', '{"な.れる","な.らす"}', 'N3', 5, 14, '6163', 'Phono-semantic: heart (忄) + 貫 ''strung through'' (phonetic カン) — the heart threaded onto a routine like coins on a string: habit.', 'Do it enough times and the heart stops noticing the string — なれる. 習慣: coins of days, all strung.'),
  ('喜', '喜', '["rejoice","take pleasure in"]'::jsonb, '{"キ"}', '{"よろこ.ぶ","よろこ.ばす"}', 'N3', 5, 12, '559c', 'Compound ideograph: the festival drum (壴) with a mouth (口) singing under it — music and voice together: joy.', 'Drumbeat plus a mouth that can''t stay closed — よろこぶ. Good news comes with percussion.'),
  ('基', '基', '["fundamentals","radical (chem)","counter for machines","foundation"]'::jsonb, '{"キ"}', '{"もと","もとい"}', 'N3', 5, 11, '57fa', 'Phono-semantic: 其 (phonetic キ) + earth (土) — the tamped earth platform everything is raised on: base, foundation.', 'Before the walls: the packed square of ground — もと, キ. 基本 is that square, in study form.'),
  ('寄', '寄', '["draw near","stop in","bring near","gather","collect","send","forward"]'::jsonb, '{"キ"}', '{"よ.る","-よ.り","よ.せる"}', 'N3', 5, 11, '5bc4', 'Phono-semantic: roof (宀) + 奇 (phonetic キ) — coming in under another''s roof: to draw near, drop in; to leave in their care: entrust.', 'Sidle up under the eaves out of the rain — よる. 駅に寄る: a small detour under a familiar roof; 寄付 leaves something behind.'),
  ('規', '規', '["standard","measure"]'::jsonb, '{"キ"}', '{}', 'N3', 5, 11, '898f', 'Compound ideograph: the grown man (夫) sighting along his compass (見) — the tool that draws true circles: standard, regulation.', 'The master checks the arc by eye and it is law — キ. 規則: circles everyone must stay inside.'),
  ('技', '技', '["skill","art","craft","ability","feat","performance","vocation","arts"]'::jsonb, '{"ギ"}', '{"わざ"}', 'N3', 5, 7, '6280', 'Phono-semantic: hand (扌) + 支 ''branch'' (phonetic ギ) — the hand''s many branches of ability: skill, technique.', 'One hand, a dozen learned branches — わざ. 技術 is the orchard fully grown.'),
  ('逆', '逆', '["inverted","reverse","opposite","wicked"]'::jsonb, '{"ギャク","ゲキ"}', '{"さか","さか.さ","さか.らう"}', 'N3', 5, 9, '9006', 'Phono-semantic: movement (辶) + 屰 ''person upside down'' (phonetic ギャク) — walking against the flow: reverse, contrary.', 'Everyone else is going the other way — and you''re inverted too — ぎゃく. 逆に: the conversational U-turn.'),
  ('久', '久', '["long time","old story"]'::jsonb, '{"キュウ","ク"}', '{"ひさ.しい"}', 'N3', 5, 3, '4e45', 'Pictograph read as a person held steady from behind — made to last: enduring, a long time.', 'Propped so it stays put for years — ひさしい. 久しぶり: the kanji you say when the prop finally slips.'),
  ('救', '救', '["salvation","save","help","rescue","reclaim"]'::jsonb, '{"キュウ"}', '{"すく.う"}', 'N3', 5, 11, '6551', 'Phono-semantic: 求 ''seek'' (phonetic キュウ) + 攵 ''acting hand'' — the hand reaching in answer to the plea: to rescue.', 'Someone calls; a hand actually arrives — すくう. 救急車: the whole kanji with a siren on it.'),
  ('旧', '旧', '["old times","old things","old friend","former","ex-"]'::jsonb, '{"キュウ"}', '{"ふる.い","もと"}', 'N3', 5, 5, '65e7', 'Simplified from 舊 (an owl over a mortar, phonetic) — the former, the old: what the calendar already used up.', 'One thin stroke propping up an old sun — キュウ. 旧道, 旧姓: roads and names from before the renovation.'),
  ('居', '居', '["reside","to be","exist","live with"]'::jsonb, '{"キョ","コ"}', '{"い.る","-い","お.る"}', 'N3', 5, 8, '5c45', 'Phono-semantic: body settled (尸) + 古 ''old'' (phonetic キョ) — staying where one has long sat: to reside, to be present.', 'Sitting in the same spot until the spot is yours — いる. 居間: the room the family''s 居る happens in.'),
  ('許', '許', '["permit","approve"]'::jsonb, '{"キョ"}', '{"ゆる.す","もと"}', 'N3', 5, 11, '8a31', 'Phono-semantic: words (言) + 午 (phonetic キョ) — the word that grants: to permit, forgive.', 'One spoken yes and the gate unlocks — ゆるす. 免許: the yes laminated into a license.'),
  ('境', '境', '["boundary","border","region"]'::jsonb, '{"キョウ","ケイ"}', '{"さかい"}', 'N3', 5, 14, '5883', 'Phono-semantic: earth (土) + 竟 ''come to an end'' (phonetic キョウ) — where the land ends: border, boundary.', 'The ground runs out of your name here — さかい. 環境: everything on both sides of your fence, technically.'),
  ('均', '均', '["level","average"]'::jsonb, '{"キン"}', '{"なら.す"}', 'N3', 5, 7, '5747', 'Phono-semantic: earth (土) + 勻 ''evenly distributed'' (phonetic キン) — ground raked flat: level, equal.', 'Rake until no clump wins — キン. 平均: the number that flattens the whole class.'),
  ('禁', '禁', '["prohibition","ban","forbid"]'::jsonb, '{"キン"}', '{}', 'N3', 5, 13, '7981', 'Compound ideograph: the sacred grove (林) around the altar (示) — ground no one may enter: forbidden.', 'Trees around the shrine: step back — キン. 禁止, 禁煙: the grove, now in sign form.'),
  ('型', '型', '["mould","type","model"]'::jsonb, '{"ケイ"}', '{"かた","-がた"}', 'N3', 5, 9, '578b', 'Phono-semantic: 刑 (phonetic ケイ) + earth (土) — the clay form castings are pressed into: mould, model, type.', 'Press the clay, lift, repeat: identical every time — かた. 血液型, A型: humans sorted by mould.'),
  ('経', '経', '["sutra","longitude","pass thru","expire","warp"]'::jsonb, '{"ケイ","キョウ","キン"}', '{"へ.る","た.つ","たていと","はか.る","のり"}', 'N3', 5, 11, '7d4c', 'Phono-semantic (simplified from 經): thread (糸) + 巠 ''warp'' — the long threads a weave runs on: to pass through (経る), the scripture lines (経), longitude.', 'The warp threads everything else crosses — ケイ. 経験 is what has passed along your threads; 経済 the nation''s weave.'),
  ('件', '件', '["affair","case","matter","item"]'::jsonb, '{"ケン"}', '{"くだん"}', 'N3', 5, 6, '4ef6', 'Compound: person (亻) + ox (牛) — a person''s head of cattle, counted one by one: an item, a case, a matter.', 'Counting the herd item by item — ケン. 事件 is the case the police count; 3件のメール the cases in your inbox.'),
  ('検', '検', '["examination","investigate"]'::jsonb, '{"ケン"}', '{"しら.べる"}', 'N3', 5, 12, '691c', 'Phono-semantic (simplified from 檢): wood (木) + 僉 (phonetic ケン) — the sealed wooden tallies checked one against another: to inspect, examine.', 'Open the wooden seals and compare — ケン. 検査 at the clinic, 検索 in the search bar: same double-check.'),
  ('険', '険', '["precipitous","inaccessible place","impregnable position","steep place","sharp eyes"]'::jsonb, '{"ケン"}', '{"けわ.しい"}', 'N3', 5, 11, '967a', 'Phono-semantic (simplified from 險): mound (阝) + 僉 (phonetic ケン) — slopes stacked steep: precipitous, perilous.', 'The hillside goes vertical where the path was promised — けわしい. 危険: the sign they bolt to it.'),
  ('減', '減', '["dwindle","decrease","reduce","decline","curtail","get hungry"]'::jsonb, '{"ゲン"}', '{"へ.る","へ.らす"}', 'N3', 5, 12, '6e1b', 'Phono-semantic: water (氵) + 咸 (phonetic ゲン) — the waterline dropping: to decrease, dwindle.', 'Yesterday''s mark on the well wall is above today''s — へる. 減る: the tide going out of anything.'),
  ('現', '現', '["present","existing","actual"]'::jsonb, '{"ゲン"}', '{"あらわ.れる","あらわ.す","うつつ","うつ.つ"}', 'N3', 5, 11, '73fe', 'Phono-semantic: jade (王) + 見 ''see'' (phonetic ゲン) — the polished stone''s luster coming visible: to appear; what is visibly here: present, actual.', 'Polish until the gleam shows up in person — あらわれる. 現在, 現実: the here, the now, the actually-so.'),
  ('限', '限', '["limit","restrict","to best of ability"]'::jsonb, '{"ゲン"}', '{"かぎ.る","かぎ.り","-かぎ.り"}', 'N3', 5, 9, '9650', 'Phono-semantic: mound (阝) + 艮 ''immovable'' (phonetic ゲン) — the ridge you cannot pass: limit, restriction.', 'The hill that ends the argument — かぎる. 限界: where the path and your legs agree to stop.'),
  ('個', '個', '["individual","counter for articles"]'::jsonb, '{"コ","カ"}', '{}', 'N3', 5, 10, '500b', 'Phono-semantic: person (亻) + 固 ''solid'' (phonetic コ) — one solid unit: an individual; the all-purpose counter 〜個.', 'One person, one solid piece, countable — コ. りんご3個: apples processed through this kanji.'),
  ('故', '故', '["happenstance","especially","intentionally","reason","cause","circumstances","the late","therefore","consequently"]'::jsonb, '{"コ"}', '{"ゆえ","ふる.い","もと"}', 'N3', 5, 9, '6545', 'Phono-semantic: 古 ''old'' (phonetic コ) + 攵 ''act upon'' — what old causes have knocked into being: reason, incident; the one now of the past: deceased.', 'Old causes still swinging their stick — ゆえ. 事故: when they hit the road; 故障: when they hit the machine.'),
  ('効', '効', '["merit","efficacy","efficiency","benefit"]'::jsonb, '{"コウ"}', '{"き.く","ききめ","なら.う"}', 'N3', 5, 8, '52b9', 'Phono-semantic: 交 (phonetic コウ) + strength (力) — force that carries across: effect, efficacy.', 'Push here, and something over there actually moves — きく. 効果: the push, receipted.'),
  ('厚', '厚', '["thick","heavy","rich","kind","cordial","brazen","shameless"]'::jsonb, '{"コウ"}', '{"あつ.い","あか"}', 'N3', 5, 9, '539a', 'Compound: strata piled under the cliff (厂) — thickness in layers; layered generosity: warm, kind.', 'Sediment stacked a canyon deep — あつい. 厚い本 for the shelf, 厚意 for the heart: both measured in layers.'),
  ('構', '構', '["posture","stance","appearance","build","set up"]'::jsonb, '{"コウ"}', '{"かま.える","かま.う"}', 'N3', 5, 14, '69cb', 'Phono-semantic: wood (木) + 冓 ''interlocked frame'' (phonetic コウ) — timbers joined into a framework: structure; the stance one builds: posture.', 'Beams lattice into a standing frame — かまえる. 結構です: ''the structure is fine as is, thank you.'''),
  ('耕', '耕', '["till","plow","cultivate"]'::jsonb, '{"コウ"}', '{"たがや.す"}', 'N3', 5, 10, '8015', 'Compound ideograph: the plow (耒) working the gridded well-field (井) — to till the land.', 'The plow drawing its lines across the grid — たがやす. 耕す: handwriting practice, but the page is a field.'),
  ('航', '航', '["navigate","sail","cruise","fly"]'::jsonb, '{"コウ"}', '{}', 'N3', 5, 10, '822a', 'Phono-semantic: boat (舟) + 亢 (phonetic コウ) — the vessel crossing open water: to navigate, sail; extended to flight.', 'Prow up, horizon locked — コウ. 航空: the boat kanji that earned wings.'),
  ('講', '講', '["lecture","club","association"]'::jsonb, '{"コウ"}', '{}', 'N3', 5, 17, '8b1b', 'Phono-semantic: words (言) + 冓 ''framework'' (phonetic コウ) — speech built beam on beam: a lecture, a course.', 'An argument with scaffolding — コウ. 講義: ninety minutes of word-carpentry.'),
  ('鉱', '鉱', '["mineral","ore"]'::jsonb, '{"コウ"}', '{"あらがね"}', 'N3', 5, 13, '9271', 'Phono-semantic (simplified from 鑛): metal (金) + 広 (phonetic コウ) — metal still spread wide in the rock: ore.', 'The vein running broad through the mountain — コウ. 鉱山: where 金 is still homework.'),
  ('告', '告', '["revelation","tell","inform","announce"]'::jsonb, '{"コク"}', '{"つ.げる"}', 'N3', 5, 7, '544a', 'Compound ideograph: the ox (牛) announced at the altar with the spoken word (口) — to declare formally: to tell, notify.', 'The announcement read out over the offering — つげる. 広告 declares to everyone; 報告 to your boss.'),
  ('混', '混', '["mix","blend","confuse"]'::jsonb, '{"コン"}', '{"ま.じる","-ま.じり","ま.ざる","ま.ぜる","こ.む"}', 'N3', 5, 11, '6df7', 'Phono-semantic: water (氵) + 昆 (phonetic コン) — many waters running together: to mix, blend, crowd.', 'Two rivers meet and forget which was which — まざる. 混雑: people doing it at rush hour.'),
  ('査', '査', '["investigate"]'::jsonb, '{"サ"}', '{}', 'N3', 5, 9, '67fb', 'Phono-semantic: wood (木) + 且 (phonetic サ) — probing with a wooden raft-pole: to examine, investigate.', 'Poke the pole in and see what comes up — サ. 調査: poking, but with clipboards.'),
  ('再', '再', '["again","twice","second time"]'::jsonb, '{"サイ","サ"}', '{"ふたた.び"}', 'N3', 5, 6, '518d', 'Pictograph: a construction frame drawn with one beam repeated — once more: again, re-.', 'The same beam, installed twice — ふたたび. 再生, 再会: the replay button of kanji.'),
  ('妻', '妻', '["wife","spouse"]'::jsonb, '{"サイ"}', '{"つま"}', 'N3', 5, 8, '59bb', 'Compound ideograph: a hand pinning up a woman''s hair — the coming-of-age coiffure of marriage: a wife.', 'The morning ritual of the pinned hair — つま. The kanji is a portrait of the wedding''s day after.'),
  ('採', '採', '["pick","take","fetch","take up"]'::jsonb, '{"サイ"}', '{"と.る"}', 'N3', 5, 11, '63a1', 'Phono-semantic: hand (扌) + 采 ''hand over a tree, plucking'' (phonetic サイ) — to gather, select, adopt.', 'Reach into the branches and choose — とる. 採用: the company picking you off the tree.'),
  ('際', '際', '["occasion","side","edge","verge","dangerous","adventurous","indecent","time","when"]'::jsonb, '{"サイ"}', '{"きわ","-ぎわ"}', 'N3', 5, 14, '969b', 'Phono-semantic: wall (阝) + 祭 (phonetic サイ) — where the wall meets the rite: the very edge, the juncture; a moment''s juncture: occasion.', 'The line where two things touch — きわ. この際: ''at this juncture''; 国際: nations touching edges.'),
  ('在', '在', '["exist","outskirts","suburbs","located in"]'::jsonb, '{"ザイ"}', '{"あ.る"}', 'N3', 5, 6, '5728', 'Phono-semantic: 才 (phonetic ザイ) + earth (土) — rooted in the ground at a place: to exist, to be located.', 'Planted here, verifiably — ザイ. 存在: existence with a street address; 現在: existing right now.'),
  ('罪', '罪', '["guilt","sin","crime","fault","blame","offense"]'::jsonb, '{"ザイ"}', '{"つみ"}', 'N3', 5, 13, '7f6a', 'Compound ideograph: the net (罒) dropping on wrongdoing (非) — the wrong that gets caught: crime, guilt.', 'The net finds what the 非 did — つみ. 犯罪: caught and filed.'),
  ('財', '財', '["property","money","wealth","assets"]'::jsonb, '{"ザイ","サイ","ゾク"}', '{"たから"}', 'N3', 5, 10, '8ca1', 'Phono-semantic: money (貝) + 才 (phonetic ザイ) — resources held as value: property, assets.', 'Raw potential converted to shells in the vault — ザイ. 財布: the vault you carry in a pocket.'),
  ('殺', '殺', '["kill","murder","butcher","slice off","split","diminish","reduce","spoil"]'::jsonb, '{"サツ","サイ","セツ"}', '{"ころ.す","-ごろ.し","そ.ぐ","あや.める"}', 'N3', 5, 10, '6bba', 'Phono-semantic: a phonetic (杀) + 殳 ''weapon-hand'' — the blow delivered: to kill; figuratively, to deaden.', 'The weapon-hand finishing what it started — ころす. The polite jobs it also does: 相殺 cancels, 殺到 floods in.'),
  ('雑', '雑', '["miscellaneous"]'::jsonb, '{"ザツ","ゾウ"}', '{"まじ.える","まじ.る"}', 'N3', 5, 14, '96d1', 'Simplified from 雜: garments of many colors gathered like a flock of birds (隹) — mixed, motley: miscellaneous.', 'A junk drawer with feathers — ザツ. 雑誌: the printed junk drawer we all love; 複雑: the drawer you can''t close.'),
  ('賛', '賛', '["approve","praise","title or inscription on picture","assist","agree with"]'::jsonb, '{"サン"}', '{"たす.ける","たた.える"}', 'N3', 5, 15, '8cdb', 'Compound: two men (夫夫) presenting treasure (貝) — bringing gifts in support: to approve, to praise.', 'Both sponsors step up with the funding: motion carried — サン. 賛成: approval with receipts.'),
  ('史', '史', '["history","chronicle"]'::jsonb, '{"シ"}', '{}', 'N3', 5, 5, '53f2', 'Pictograph: a hand gripping the record-keeper''s tablet — the court archivist: history, chronicle.', 'The scribe''s fist around the official tablet — シ. 歴史: what survived his edits.'),
  ('師', '師', '["expert","teacher","master","model","exemplar","army (incl. counter)","war"]'::jsonb, '{"シ"}', '{"いくさ"}', 'N3', 5, 10, '5e2b', 'Compound: troops (𠂤) under one banner — a full division; the one who commands mastery: teacher, master.', 'The banner everyone falls in behind — シ. 医師, 教師: masters of their divisions.'),
  ('志', '志', '["intention","plan","resolve","aspire","motive","hopes","shilling"]'::jsonb, '{"シ"}', '{"シリング","こころざ.す","こころざし"}', 'N3', 5, 7, '5fd7', 'Compound: the heart (心) going forward (士, originally 之 ''to go'') — where the heart is headed: intention, ambition.', 'The heart with a destination stamped on it — こころざし. 意志: will, with the compass already set.'),
  ('支', '支', '["branch","support","sustain","branch radical (no. 65)"]'::jsonb, '{"シ"}', '{"ささ.える","つか.える","か.う"}', 'N3', 5, 4, '652f', 'Pictograph: a hand (又) holding a cut branch (十) — a branch; what a branch does under weight: support.', 'Snap off a limb, prop the load with it — ささえる. 支店: the branch office; 支払い: support rendered in cash.'),
  ('枝', '枝', '["bough","branch","twig","limb","counter for branches"]'::jsonb, '{"シ"}', '{"えだ"}', 'N3', 5, 8, '679d', 'Phono-semantic: tree (木) + 支 (phonetic シ) — the branch still on the tree: a bough.', '支 was the branch in your hand; put the 木 back and it''s still growing — えだ.'),
  ('資', '資', '["assets","resources","capital","funds","data","be conducive to","contribute to"]'::jsonb, '{"シ"}', '{}', 'N3', 5, 13, '8cc7', 'Phono-semantic: 次 (phonetic シ) + money (貝) — wealth staged for the next move: capital, resources.', 'Money already earmarked for what comes next — シ. 資料 feeds meetings; 資本 feeds companies.'),
  ('似', '似', '["becoming","resemble","counterfeit","imitate","suitable"]'::jsonb, '{"ジ"}', '{"に.る","ひ.る"}', 'N3', 5, 7, '4f3c', 'Phono-semantic: person (亻) + 以 (phonetic ジ) — one person taken for another: to resemble.', 'Squint and it''s the same person — にる. 似ている: the double-take kanji.'),
  ('示', '示', '["show","indicate","point out","express","display"]'::jsonb, '{"ジ","シ"}', '{"しめ.す"}', 'N3', 5, 5, '793a', 'Pictograph: the altar table with offerings — where heaven shows its signs; as a component (示/ネ) it marks everything sacred.', 'The altar displays; the sky replies — しめす. 指示 and 表示: the showing, secularized.'),
  ('識', '識', '["discriminating","know","write"]'::jsonb, '{"シキ"}', '{"し.る","しる.す"}', 'N3', 5, 19, '8b58', 'Phono-semantic: words (言) + 戠 (phonetic シキ) — marking distinctions in words: to discriminate, to know.', 'Telling things apart precisely enough to name them — シキ. 知識: the label-maker of the mind; 常識: the labels everyone shares.'),
  ('授', '授', '["impart","instruct","grant","confer"]'::jsonb, '{"ジュ"}', '{"さず.ける","さず.かる"}', 'N3', 5, 11, '6388', 'Compound: hand (扌) + 受 ''receive'' — the giving side of the handover: to impart, confer.', '受 receives; add the hand and you''re the one giving — さずける. 授業: knowledge, handed across a desk.'),
  ('修', '修', '["discipline","conduct oneself well","study","master"]'::jsonb, '{"シュウ","シュ"}', '{"おさ.める","おさ.まる"}', 'N3', 5, 10, '4fee', 'Phono-semantic: a person under the rod with finishing strokes (彡) — polished by training: to cultivate, master, repair.', 'Sanded, corrected, sanded again — おさめる. 修理 repairs machines; 研修 repairs employees.'),
  ('術', '術', '["art","technique","skill","means","trick","resources","magic"]'::jsonb, '{"ジュツ"}', '{"すべ"}', 'N3', 5, 11, '8853', 'Phono-semantic: 行 ''ways'' + 朮 (phonetic ジュツ) — the practiced path through a craft: technique, art.', 'The route through the maze that only training finds — ジュツ. 手術: technique at its most unforgiving.'),
  ('述', '述', '["mention","state","speak","relate"]'::jsonb, '{"ジュツ"}', '{"の.べる"}', 'N3', 5, 8, '8ff0', 'Phono-semantic: movement (辶) + 朮 (phonetic ジュツ) — following the thread of an account aloud: to state, relate.', 'Walk the listener down the path step by step — のべる. 記述: the walk, written down.'),
  ('準', '準', '["semi-","correspond to","proportionate to","conform","imitate"]'::jsonb, '{"ジュン"}', '{"じゅん.じる","じゅん.ずる","なぞら.える","のり","ひと.しい","みずもり"}', 'N3', 5, 13, '6e96', 'Phono-semantic: water (氵) + 隼 (phonetic ジュン) — the water-level as the standard: level, standard; almost at level: semi-.', 'The spirit level''s bubble — ジュン. 準備 brings things level before the start; 準決勝 is one level below the final.'),
  ('招', '招', '["beckon","invite","summon","engage"]'::jsonb, '{"ショウ"}', '{"まね.く"}', 'N3', 5, 8, '62db', 'Phono-semantic: hand (扌) + 召 ''summon'' (phonetic ショウ) — the hand waving someone in: to beckon, invite.', 'The maneki-neko''s exact gesture — まねく. 招待: the wave, engraved on cardstock.'),
  ('象', '象', '["elephant","pattern after","imitate","image","shape","sign (of the times)"]'::jsonb, '{"ショウ","ゾウ"}', '{"かたど.る"}', 'N3', 5, 12, '8c61', 'Pictograph: an elephant — trunk at the top, massive body and legs below; borrowed for ''image, phenomenon'' (few had seen one; all imagined it).', 'Trunk, bulk, legs: the animal everyone described and nobody had met — ゾウ. 印象: the elephant your mind keeps of things.'),
  ('賞', '賞', '["prize","reward","praise"]'::jsonb, '{"ショウ"}', '{"ほ.める"}', 'N3', 5, 15, '8cde', 'Phono-semantic: 尚 ''esteem'' (phonetic ショウ) + money (貝) — esteem paid out in treasure: a prize.', 'Applause with a check stapled to it — ショウ. ノーベル賞: the loudest staple.'),
  ('常', '常', '["usual","ordinary","normal","common","regular","continually","always","long-lasting"]'::jsonb, '{"ジョウ"}', '{"つね","とこ-"}', 'N3', 5, 11, '5e38', 'Phono-semantic: 尚 (phonetic ジョウ) + cloth (巾) — the long banner always flying: constant, usual.', 'The flag that never comes down — つね. 非常口 is the door for when ''always'' breaks.'),
  ('情', '情', '["feelings","emotion","passion","sympathy","circumstances","facts"]'::jsonb, '{"ジョウ","セイ"}', '{"なさ.け"}', 'N3', 5, 11, '60c5', 'Phono-semantic: heart (忄) + 青 (phonetic ジョウ) — the heart''s living color: emotion; the color things actually have: circumstances.', 'The heart showing its true blue — なさけ. 感情 is the palette; 情報 the world''s colors, reported.'),
  ('条', '条', '["article","clause","counter for articles, clauses, paragraphs, etc.","twig","item","stripe","streak"]'::jsonb, '{"ジョウ","チョウ","デキ"}', '{"えだ","すじ"}', 'N3', 5, 7, '6761', 'Simplified from 條: a slender branch — a long thin line; lines of a document: articles, clauses.', 'One twig = one line of the contract — ジョウ. 条件: the twigs your yes hangs on.'),
  ('状', '状', '["status quo","conditions","circumstances","form","appearance"]'::jsonb, '{"ジョウ"}', '{}', 'N3', 5, 7, '72b6', 'Phono-semantic: 爿 (phonetic ジョウ) + 犬 — originally the dog''s form/appearance: shape, state; the document describing a state: a letter.', 'A snapshot of how things stand right now — ジョウ. 状態 is the picture; 賞状 the framed kind.'),
  ('職', '職', '["post","employment","work"]'::jsonb, '{"ショク","ソク"}', '{}', 'N3', 5, 18, '8077', 'Phono-semantic: ear (耳) + 戠 (phonetic ショク) — the duties one is charged with (heard and obeyed): office, occupation.', 'The job description read into your ear on day one — ショク. 就職: the ear accepts; 職場: where it reports.'),
  ('制', '制', '["system","law","rule"]'::jsonb, '{"セイ"}', '{}', 'N3', 5, 8, '5236', 'Compound: pruning a tree with the blade (刂) — cutting to shape: to regulate, control; the shape imposed: a system.', 'The hedge trimmed until it obeys — セイ. 制服 prunes the wardrobe; 制度 prunes society.'),
  ('勢', '勢', '["forces","energy","military strength"]'::jsonb, '{"セイ","ゼイ"}', '{"いきお.い","はずみ"}', 'N3', 5, 13, '52e2', 'Phono-semantic: 埶 (phonetic セイ) + strength (力) — strength in full swing: momentum, force.', 'Not just muscle: muscle already moving — いきおい. 勢い: the part of force you can''t fake.'),
  ('性', '性', '["sex","gender","nature"]'::jsonb, '{"セイ","ショウ"}', '{"さが"}', 'N3', 5, 8, '6027', 'Compound: heart (忄) + 生 ''born'' (phonetic セイ) — the heart as it was born: innate nature; one''s born kind: sex, gender.', 'What the heart came installed with — セイ. 性格 is the factory settings; 女性・男性 the hardware line.'),
  ('政', '政', '["politics","government"]'::jsonb, '{"セイ","ショウ"}', '{"まつりごと","まん"}', 'N3', 5, 9, '653f', 'Compound: 正 ''correct'' (phonetic セイ) + 攵 ''enforcing hand'' — correcting with authority: governance.', 'Straightening society with a stick — セイ. 政治: the stick, debated on television.'),
  ('精', '精', '["refined","ghost","fairy","energy","vitality","semen","excellence","purity","skill"]'::jsonb, '{"セイ","ショウ"}', '{"しら.げる","くわ.しい"}', 'N3', 5, 14, '7cbe', 'Phono-semantic: rice (米) + 青 (phonetic セイ) — rice polished to its pure heart: refined; the concentrated essence: spirit, vigor.', 'Polish the grain down to its gleam — セイ. 精神: you, similarly polished.'),
  ('製', '製', '["made in...","manufacture"]'::jsonb, '{"セイ"}', '{}', 'N3', 5, 14, '88fd', 'Phono-semantic: 制 ''cut to shape'' (phonetic セイ) + garment (衣) — cloth cut and sewn: to manufacture; ''made in''.', 'Cut the pattern, sew the label — セイ. 日本製: the tag this kanji lives on.'),
  ('税', '税', '["tax","duty"]'::jsonb, '{"ゼイ"}', '{}', 'N3', 5, 12, '7a0e', 'Phono-semantic: grain (禾) + 兌 (phonetic ゼイ) — the share of the harvest handed over: tax.', 'So many sheaves per field, collected annually — ゼイ. 消費税: the sheaf taken at the register.'),
  ('績', '績', '["exploits","achievements","unreeling cocoons"]'::jsonb, '{"セキ"}', '{}', 'N3', 5, 17, '7e3e', 'Phono-semantic: thread (糸) + 責 (phonetic セキ) — thread spun as one''s tallied output: accomplishments, results.', 'Your spool at day''s end, measured — セキ. 成績: the spool with a grade on it.'),
  ('責', '責', '["blame","condemn","censure"]'::jsonb, '{"セキ"}', '{"せ.める"}', 'N3', 5, 11, '8cac', 'Phono-semantic: a thorn over money (貝) — the debt that pricks: to press for payment, to blame; what presses on you: responsibility.', 'The unpaid bill with a spike through it — せめる. 責任: the spike you agree to hold.'),
  ('接', '接', '["touch","contact","adjoin","piece together"]'::jsonb, '{"セツ","ショウ"}', '{"つ.ぐ"}', 'N3', 5, 11, '63a5', 'Phono-semantic: hand (扌) + 妾 (phonetic セツ) — brought into direct contact: to touch, join, receive visitors.', 'Two surfaces meeting without a gap — セツ. 直接: contact with nothing in between; 面接: contact across an interview table.'),
  ('設', '設', '["establishment","provision","prepare"]'::jsonb, '{"セツ"}', '{"もう.ける"}', 'N3', 5, 11, '8a2d', 'Compound: words (言) + 殳 ''working hand'' — ordering the work and setting it up: to establish, install.', 'Say where it goes, then build it there — もうける. 設計 is the saying; 建設 the hammering.'),
  ('絶', '絶', '["discontinue","sever","cut off","abstain","interrupt","suppress","be beyond","without match","peerless","unparalleled"]'::jsonb, '{"ゼツ"}', '{"た.える","た.やす","た.つ"}', 'N3', 5, 12, '7d76', 'Compound: thread (糸) cut clean — the line broken: to sever, cease; cut off from all else: absolute.', 'Snip — and no thread continues — たえる. 絶対: cut off from every alternative.'),
  ('祖', '祖', '["ancestor","pioneer","founder"]'::jsonb, '{"ソ"}', '{}', 'N3', 5, 9, '7956', 'Phono-semantic: altar (ネ) + 且 ''stacked tablets'' (phonetic ソ) — the ancestral tablets on the altar: forebears.', 'The shelf of name-tablets, oldest on top — ソ. 祖父, 祖母: the two nearest tablets, still warm.'),
  ('総', '総', '["general","whole","all","full","total"]'::jsonb, '{"ソウ"}', '{"す.べて","すべ.て","ふさ"}', 'N3', 5, 14, '7dcf', 'Phono-semantic: thread (糸) + a phonetic (ソウ) — all strands gathered into one binding: total, overall.', 'Every thread pulled into a single knot at the top — ソウ. 総理大臣: the knot itself.'),
  ('像', '像', '["statue","picture","image","figure","portrait"]'::jsonb, '{"ゾウ"}', '{}', 'N3', 5, 14, '50cf', 'Phono-semantic: person (亻) + 象 ''image'' (phonetic ゾウ) — the likeness given body: a statue, an image.', 'The imagined elephant, finally carved — ゾウ. 想像 imagines it; 銅像 parks it in the square.'),
  ('増', '増', '["increase","add","augment","gain","promote"]'::jsonb, '{"ゾウ"}', '{"ま.す","ま.し","ふ.える","ふ.やす"}', 'N3', 5, 14, '5897', 'Phono-semantic: earth (土) + 曽 ''layers'' (phonetic ゾウ) — earth heaped layer on layer: to increase.', 'Another shovelful on the mound, daily — ふえる. 増える: the mound''s autobiography.'),
  ('造', '造', '["create","make","structure","physique"]'::jsonb, '{"ゾウ"}', '{"つく.る","つく.り","-づく.り"}', 'N3', 5, 10, '9020', 'Phono-semantic: movement (辶) + 告 (phonetic ゾウ) — work advanced to completion: to construct, create.', 'Announce the project, then walk it into existence — つくる. 木造: made by this kanji, in wood.'),
  ('則', '則', '["rule","law","follow","based on","model after"]'::jsonb, '{"ソク"}', '{"のっと.る","のり","すなわち"}', 'N3', 5, 9, '5247', 'Compound ideograph: laws engraved by blade (刂) on the bronze tripod (貝-form) — the inscribed standard: rule.', 'Cut into bronze so no one can argue — ソク. 規則: the tripod''s descendants, laminated.'),
  ('測', '測', '["fathom","plan","scheme","measure"]'::jsonb, '{"ソク"}', '{"はか.る"}', 'N3', 5, 12, '6e2c', 'Phono-semantic: water (氵) + 則 (phonetic ソク) — sounding the depth by the standard line: to measure, fathom.', 'Drop the knotted rope till it touches bottom — はかる. 予測: measuring water that hasn''t arrived yet.'),
  ('損', '損', '["damage","loss","disadvantage","hurt","injure"]'::jsonb, '{"ソン"}', '{"そこ.なう","そこな.う","-そこ.なう","そこ.ねる","-そこ.ねる"}', 'N3', 5, 13, '640d', 'Phono-semantic: hand (扌) + 員 (phonetic ソン) — taken away by hand: to diminish, damage; the diminished side: a loss.', 'A hand skims off the top and the total drops — ソン. 損する: coming out lighter than you went in.'),
  ('団', '団', '["group","association"]'::jsonb, '{"ダン","トン"}', '{"かたまり","まる.い"}', 'N3', 5, 6, '56e3', 'Phono-semantic (simplified from 團): enclosure (囗) + a phonetic — people rolled into one round body: a group, a troupe.', 'Everyone squeezed into one circle — ダン. 布団 rolls bedding the same way; 団体 rolls people.'),
  ('断', '断', '["severance","decline","refuse","apologize","warn","dismiss","prohibit","decision","judgement","cutting"]'::jsonb, '{"ダン"}', '{"た.つ","ことわ.る","さだ.める"}', 'N3', 5, 11, '65ad', 'Compound (simplified from 斷): the axe (斤) chopping through bound threads — to cut off: to sever, to refuse, to judge decisively.', 'One axe-fall through the whole tangle — ことわる. 断る declines; 判断 cuts the question in two and picks.'),
  ('築', '築', '["fabricate","build","construct"]'::jsonb, '{"チク"}', '{"きず.く"}', 'N3', 5, 16, '7bc9', 'Phono-semantic: 筑 (phonetic チク) + wood (木) — earth rammed between wooden forms: to construct, build.', 'Frame, fill, tamp, repeat: walls rise — きずく. 建築: the tamping, professionalized.'),
  ('貯', '貯', '["savings","store","lay in","keep","wear mustache"]'::jsonb, '{"チョ"}', '{"た.める","たくわ.える"}', 'N3', 5, 12, '8caf', 'Phono-semantic: money (貝) + 宁 ''stowed'' (phonetic チョ) — treasure put by under the roof: to store, save.', 'Shells stacked in the cupboard for winter — チョ. 貯金: the cupboard at the bank.'),
  ('張', '張', '["counter for bows & stringed instruments","stretch","spread","put up (tent)"]'::jsonb, '{"チョウ"}', '{"は.る","-は.り","-ば.り"}', 'N3', 5, 11, '5f35', 'Phono-semantic: bow (弓) + 長 ''long'' (phonetic チョウ) — the bowstring drawn long: to stretch, extend; taut effort (頑張る).', 'Pull the string until the bow groans — はる. 頑張って: stay drawn, don''t loose yet.'),
  ('停', '停', '["halt","stopping"]'::jsonb, '{"テイ"}', '{"と.める","と.まる"}', 'N3', 5, 11, '505c', 'Phono-semantic: person (亻) + 亭 ''roadside pavilion'' (phonetic テイ) — the traveler stopped at the rest-house: to halt.', 'Pull over at the little pavilion — テイ. バス停: the pavilion, reduced to a pole and a sign.'),
  ('程', '程', '["extent","degree","law","formula","distance","limits","amount"]'::jsonb, '{"テイ"}', '{"ほど","-ほど"}', 'N3', 5, 12, '7a0b', 'Phono-semantic: grain (禾) + 呈 (phonetic テイ) — the measured-out portion: extent, degree, the ''about how much''.', 'How far up the measuring pole the grain reaches — ほど. これほど, 程度: quantity with manners.'),
  ('適', '適', '["suitable","occasional","rare","qualified","capable"]'::jsonb, '{"テキ"}', '{"かな.う"}', 'N3', 5, 14, '9069', 'Phono-semantic: movement (辶) + 啇 (phonetic テキ) — going exactly where one should: fitting, suitable.', 'The key that walks to its own lock — テキ. 適当 can mean ''perfectly apt'' or ''whatever works'' — Japanese shrugs.'),
  ('導', '導', '["guidance","leading","conduct","usher"]'::jsonb, '{"ドウ"}', '{"みちび.く"}', 'N3', 5, 15, '5c0e', 'Compound: road (道) + hand (寸) — a hand on your shoulder along the way: to guide, lead.', 'Someone who knows the road, walking you down it — みちびく. 指導: the hand that corrects your grip.'),
  ('銅', '銅', '["copper"]'::jsonb, '{"ドウ"}', '{"あかがね"}', 'N3', 5, 14, '9285', 'Phono-semantic: metal (金) + 同 (phonetic ドウ) — the everyday red metal: copper.', 'The metal that''s the ''same'' everywhere: pipes, coins, wire — ドウ. 銅メダル: third place, honest metal.'),
  ('得', '得', '["gain","get","find","earn","acquire","can","may","able to","profit","advantage","benefit"]'::jsonb, '{"トク"}', '{"え.る","う.る"}', 'N3', 5, 11, '5f97', 'Compound ideograph: walking (彳) and picking up a cowrie (貝→旦) with the hand (寸) — finding value on the road: to gain, to be able.', 'Money found mid-stride — える. 得する: the walk that pays for itself; 納得: when understanding is the coin.'),
  ('毒', '毒', '["poison","virus","venom","germ","harm","injury","spite"]'::jsonb, '{"ドク"}', '{}', 'N3', 5, 8, '6bd2', 'Compound: lush growth over 毋 ''do not'' — the plant you must not touch: poison.', 'The prettiest plant in the garden, fenced off — ドク. 毒: nature''s ''do not'' sign.'),
  ('独', '独', '["single","alone","spontaneously","Germany"]'::jsonb, '{"ドク","トク"}', '{"ひと.り"}', 'N3', 5, 9, '72ec', 'Phono-semantic (simplified from 獨): dog (犭) + a phonetic — the dog that hunts alone: solitary, single; also ''German'' (独逸).', 'One dog, one bug, no company — ひとり. 独身: single, as a lifestyle; 独学: alone, as a school.'),
  ('任', '任', '["responsibility","duty","term","entrust to","appoint"]'::jsonb, '{"ニン"}', '{"まか.せる","まか.す"}', 'N3', 5, 6, '4efb', 'Phono-semantic: person (亻) + 壬 ''carrying-pole'' (phonetic ニン) — the load laid on someone''s shoulders: duty, appointment.', 'The pole settles onto your shoulders: it''s yours now — まかせる. 責任: the pole with your name burned in.'),
  ('燃', '燃', '["burn","blaze","glow"]'::jsonb, '{"ネン"}', '{"も.える","も.やす","も.す"}', 'N3', 5, 16, '71c3', 'Phono-semantic: fire (火) + 然 (phonetic ネン — which originally meant ''to burn'' before being borrowed for ''thus'') — fire reclaiming its old word: to burn.', '然 lost its flames to grammar, so it came back with a torch — もえる. 燃えるゴミ: Tuesday''s burnable truth.'),
  ('能', '能', '["ability","talent","skill","capacity"]'::jsonb, '{"ノウ"}', '{"よ.く","あた.う"}', 'N3', 5, 10, '80fd', 'Pictograph: originally a bear — an animal of legendary strength and skill; borrowed for ''to be able'': ability.', 'Strong as a bear, and clever with it — ノウ. 可能, 能力: the bear inside your skill set; 能 theater borrowed its gravitas.'),
  ('破', '破', '["rend","rip","tear","break","destroy","defeat","frustrate"]'::jsonb, '{"ハ"}', '{"やぶ.る","やぶ.れる","わ.れる"}', 'N3', 5, 10, '7834', 'Phono-semantic: stone (石) + 皮 (phonetic ハ) — stone tearing through hide: to rip, break, defeat.', 'Rock meets leather; leather loses — やぶる. 破れる: the sound this kanji makes.'),
  ('判', '判', '["judgement","judgment","signature","stamp","seal"]'::jsonb, '{"ハン","バン"}', '{"わか.る"}', 'N3', 5, 7, '5224', 'Phono-semantic: 半 ''half'' (phonetic ハン) + blade (刂) — cutting a matter cleanly in two: to judge; the seal that ratifies it.', 'The verdict splits the case down the middle — ハン. 裁判: professionals with very steady knives.'),
  ('版', '版', '["printing block","printing plate","edition","impression","label"]'::jsonb, '{"ハン"}', '{}', 'N3', 5, 8, '7248', 'Phono-semantic: split wood (片) + 反 (phonetic ハン) — the carved plank pressed and flipped: a printing block, an edition.', 'Carve once, print a thousand — ハン. 出版: the plank that became an industry.'),
  ('犯', '犯', '["crime","sin","offense"]'::jsonb, '{"ハン","ボン"}', '{"おか.す"}', 'N3', 5, 5, '72af', 'Phono-semantic: beast (犭) + 㔾 (phonetic ハン) — the animal impulse breaking bounds: to violate, commit.', 'The leash snaps and the line is crossed — おかす. 犯人: whoever''s holding the empty leash.'),
  ('比', '比', '["compare","race","ratio","Philippines"]'::jsonb, '{"ヒ"}', '{"くら.べる"}', 'N3', 5, 4, '6bd4', 'Pictograph: two people standing in a row, matched against each other — to compare; a ratio.', 'Stand them back to back and measure — くらべる. 比べる: humanity''s oldest chart.'),
  ('費', '費', '["expense","cost","spend","consume","waste"]'::jsonb, '{"ヒ"}', '{"つい.やす","つい.える"}', 'N3', 5, 12, '8cbb', 'Phono-semantic: 弗 (phonetic ヒ) + money (貝) — money flowing out through the strainer: expense, cost.', '貝 with 弗 on top — practically the dollar sign bleeding shells — ヒ. 交通費, 生活費: the strainers of a paycheck.'),
  ('非', '非', '["un-","mistake","negative","injustice","non-"]'::jsonb, '{"ヒ"}', '{"あら.ず"}', 'N3', 5, 8, '975e', 'Pictograph: a bird''s wings spread in opposite directions — divergence: not, contrary to, wrong.', 'Wings that agree on nothing — ヒ. Prefix of the opposite: 非常, 非公開; inside 悲, it tears the heart.'),
  ('備', '備', '["equip","provision","preparation"]'::jsonb, '{"ビ"}', '{"そな.える","そな.わる","つぶさ.に"}', 'N3', 5, 12, '5099', 'Compound: a person (亻) with the quiver stocked at their side — arrows ready before the need: to equip, prepare.', 'Full quiver before the hunt — そなえる. 準備 checks the arrows; 設備 bolts them to the wall.'),
  ('評', '評', '["evaluate","criticism","comment"]'::jsonb, '{"ヒョウ"}', '{}', 'N3', 5, 12, '8a55', 'Phono-semantic: words (言) + 平 ''level'' (phonetic ヒョウ) — weighing something in words until the scale sits level: to evaluate.', 'Verbal scales: praise on one pan, faults on the other — ヒョウ. 評判: where the needle settled publicly.'),
  ('貧', '貧', '["poverty","poor"]'::jsonb, '{"ヒン","ビン"}', '{"まず.しい"}', 'N3', 5, 11, '8ca7', 'Compound ideograph: money (貝) divided (分) too many ways — wealth split until none remains: poor.', 'One shell, eight heirs — まずしい. 貧乏: arithmetic as tragedy.'),
  ('婦', '婦', '["lady","woman","wife","bride"]'::jsonb, '{"フ"}', '{"よめ"}', 'N3', 5, 11, '5a66', 'Compound ideograph: woman (女) + broom (帚) — the married woman who keeps the house: lady, wife.', 'The broom is hers, and so is the household — フ. 夫婦: pole-carrier and broom-holder, incorporated.'),
  ('布', '布', '["linen","cloth","spread","distribute"]'::jsonb, '{"フ","ホ"}', '{"ぬの","し.く","きれ"}', 'N3', 5, 5, '5e03', 'Phono-semantic: hand + cloth (巾) — woven cloth held out: linen; what cloth does when shaken open: to spread.', 'Unfurl the bolt across the counter — ぬの. 布団 spreads it on the floor; 財布 folds it around money.'),
  ('武', '武', '["warrior","military","chivalry","arms"]'::jsonb, '{"ブ","ム"}', '{"たけ","たけ.し"}', 'N3', 5, 8, '6b66', 'Compound ideograph: halberd (戈) + foot (止) — marching under arms; the classical gloss ''stopping spears'' reads it as strength that ends fighting: military.', 'Armed and advancing — or armed so no one else does — ブ. 武士: the kanji with a sword through its walk.'),
  ('復', '復', '["restore","return to","revert","resume"]'::jsonb, '{"フク"}', '{"また"}', 'N3', 5, 12, '5fa9', 'Phono-semantic: step (彳) + 复 ''go back over'' (phonetic フク) — walking the same road again: to return, restore, repeat.', 'Retrace the route until it''s yours — フク. 復習 re-walks the lesson; 回復 re-walks you back to health.'),
  ('複', '複', '["duplicate","double","compound","multiple"]'::jsonb, '{"フク"}', '{}', 'N3', 5, 14, '8907', 'Phono-semantic: garment (衤) + 复 (phonetic フク) — clothing lined double: duplicated, compound.', 'The coat with a second coat sewn inside — フク. 複雑: layers past counting.'),
  ('仏', '仏', '["Buddha","the dead","France"]'::jsonb, '{"ブツ","フツ"}', '{"ほとけ"}', 'N3', 5, 4, '4ecf', 'Simplified from 佛: person (亻) + a phonetic — the Awakened One rendered human-side-first: Buddha; also France (仏蘭西).', 'A person turned slightly inward — ほとけ. 仏教 walks that turn; 大仏 casts it in bronze.'),
  ('粉', '粉', '["flour","powder","dust"]'::jsonb, '{"フン"}', '{"デシメートル","こ","こな"}', 'N3', 5, 10, '7c89', 'Compound ideograph: rice (米) divided fine (分) — grain ground to dust: flour, powder.', 'Rice split until it''s weather — こな. 小麦粉: wheat that met this kanji.'),
  ('編', '編', '["compilation","knit","plait","braid","twist","editing","completed poem","part of a book"]'::jsonb, '{"ヘン"}', '{"あ.む","-あ.み"}', 'N3', 5, 15, '7de8', 'Phono-semantic: thread (糸) + 扁 ''flat tablets'' (phonetic ヘン) — bamboo slips laced into a book: to compile; the same lacing in wool: to knit.', 'Pages stitched in order, stitches paged in order — あむ. 編集: knitting other people''s words.'),
  ('保', '保', '["protect","guarantee","keep","preserve","sustain","support"]'::jsonb, '{"ホ","ホウ"}', '{"たも.つ"}', 'N3', 5, 9, '4fdd', 'Compound ideograph: a person (亻) carrying an infant (呆) — holding safe: to protect, keep, guarantee.', 'Carried the way you carry a newborn — たもつ. 保険 charges monthly for those arms.'),
  ('報', '報', '["report","news","reward","retribution"]'::jsonb, '{"ホウ"}', '{"むく.いる"}', 'N3', 5, 12, '5831', 'Compound: a sentenced man (幸, the manacles) brought to account — requital delivered: to repay; the news of it: report.', 'The verdict comes back to its sender — ホウ. 情報 is the flow; 報告 the memo; 報い the karma.'),
  ('豊', '豊', '["bountiful","excellent","rich"]'::jsonb, '{"ホウ","ブ"}', '{"ゆた.か","とよ"}', 'N3', 5, 13, '8c4a', 'Pictograph: the ritual vessel (豆) heaped over the brim — abundance offered: bountiful.', 'The altar bowl stacked past sense — ゆたか. 豊か: the harvest photographed for the brochure.'),
  ('暴', '暴', '["outburst","rave","fret","force","violence","cruelty","outrage"]'::jsonb, '{"ボウ","バク"}', '{"あば.く","あば.れる"}', 'N3', 5, 15, '66b4', 'Compound: grain flung out in both hands to dry under the fierce sun — exposure; fierce as that sun: violent, sudden.', 'Everything hurled out at once under a punishing sky — あばれる. 暴力, 暴走: the kanji off its leash.'),
  ('貿', '貿', '["trade","exchange"]'::jsonb, '{"ボウ"}', '{}', 'N3', 5, 12, '8cbf', 'Phono-semantic: 卯 (phonetic ボウ) + money (貝) — goods exchanged across thresholds: trade.', 'Shells passing through the open hatch, both directions — ボウ. 貿易: the hatch scaled to harbors.'),
  ('防', '防', '["ward off","defend","protect","resist"]'::jsonb, '{"ボウ"}', '{"ふせ.ぐ"}', 'N3', 5, 7, '9632', 'Phono-semantic: mound (阝) + 方 (phonetic ボウ) — the embankment raised against the flood: to defend, prevent.', 'The levee facing the right direction before the rain — ふせぐ. 予防: the levee built early; 消防 the one that runs.'),
  ('務', '務', '["task","duties"]'::jsonb, '{"ム"}', '{"つと.める"}', 'N3', 5, 11, '52d9', 'Phono-semantic: 敄 (phonetic ム) + strength (力) — effort pressed into service: duties, business.', 'Spear, stick and muscle: whatever the office demands — つとめる. 事務: the same kanji at a desk.'),
  ('夢', '夢', '["dream","vision","illusion"]'::jsonb, '{"ム","ボウ"}', '{"ゆめ","ゆめ.みる","くら.い"}', 'N3', 5, 13, '5922', 'Compound: eyes veiled (罒+冖) in the deep of evening (夕) under a tangle of growth — what the closed eye sees: a dream.', 'Grass, veil, dusk — and behind the lids, a whole cinema — ゆめ. 夢を見る: ''to see a dream'', never merely have one.'),
  ('迷', '迷', '["astray","be perplexed","in doubt","lost","err","illusion"]'::jsonb, '{"メイ"}', '{"まよ.う"}', 'N3', 5, 9, '8ff7', 'Phono-semantic: movement (辶) + 米 (phonetic メイ) — paths crossing like the strokes of 米: to lose the way, to waver.', 'Six paths radiate from one point; you take the seventh — まよう. 迷惑: your wandering, billed to others.'),
  ('綿', '綿', '["cotton"]'::jsonb, '{"メン"}', '{"わた"}', 'N3', 5, 14, '7dbf', 'Compound ideograph: thread (糸) + white cloth (帛) — fiber spun into soft white cloth: cotton.', 'White fluff queued to become thread — わた. 綿100%: the tag''s favorite kanji.'),
  ('輸', '輸', '["transport","send","be inferior"]'::jsonb, '{"ユ","シュ"}', '{}', 'N3', 5, 16, '8f38', 'Phono-semantic: cart (車) + 兪 (phonetic ユ) — goods carried over: to transport, ship.', 'Cart to boat, boat to cart, cargo unbothered — ユ. 輸入 and 輸出: this kanji at both ends of the sea.'),
  ('余', '余', '["too much","myself","surplus","other","remainder"]'::jsonb, '{"ヨ"}', '{"あま.る","あま.り","あま.す","あんま.り"}', 'N3', 5, 7, '4f59', 'Pictograph read as a roofed storehouse on posts — what stays in storage after needs are met: surplus, remainder.', 'The shed still half full after winter — あまる. 余裕: surplus as a personality trait.'),
  ('容', '容', '["contain","form","looks"]'::jsonb, '{"ヨウ"}', '{"い.れる"}', 'N3', 5, 10, '5bb9', 'Phono-semantic: roof (宀) + 谷 ''valley'' (phonetic ヨウ) — a space roomy as a valley under one roof: to contain; what it holds: appearance, content.', 'A house with a valley''s capacity — ヨウ. 内容 is what''s inside; 容器 the thing doing the holding.'),
  ('率', '率', '["ratio","rate","proportion","%","factor","lead","spearhead","command"]'::jsonb, '{"ソツ","リツ","シュツ"}', '{"ひき.いる"}', 'N3', 5, 11, '7387', 'Pictograph: a twisted rope with fibers flying — pulling all strands together: to lead (率いる); the proportion of strands: rate, ratio.', 'One rope, many fibers, one count per hundred — リツ. 確率: how many fibers hold; 率いる: who pulls the rope.'),
  ('略', '略', '["abbreviation","omission","outline","shorten","capture","plunder"]'::jsonb, '{"リャク"}', '{"ほぼ","はぶ.く","おか.す","おさ.める","はかりごと","はか.る"}', 'N3', 5, 11, '7565', 'Phono-semantic: field (田) + 各 (phonetic リャク) — land marked off by plan: to plot (strategy); the plan shortened to its lines: abbreviation.', 'The campaign map, then the map''s shorthand — リャク. 省略: leaving out what the sketch implies.'),
  ('留', '留', '["detain","fasten","halt","stop"]'::jsonb, '{"リュウ","ル"}', '{"と.める","と.まる","とど.める","とど.まる","るうぶる"}', 'N3', 5, 10, '7559', 'Phono-semantic: 卯 (phonetic リュウ) + field (田) — held fast on the land: to stay, to fasten, to detain.', 'The gate latched with you inside — とまる. 留学 latches you abroad; 留守 is the latched, empty house.'),
  ('領', '領', '["jurisdiction","dominion","territory","fief","reign"]'::jsonb, '{"リョウ"}', '{"えり"}', 'N3', 5, 14, '9818', 'Phono-semantic: 令 ''command'' (phonetic リョウ) + head (頁) — the neck and collar, where command takes hold: domain, jurisdiction.', 'Grab the collar and you steer the coat — リョウ. 大統領: the collar of a whole nation.'),
  ('歴', '歴', '["curriculum","continuation","passage of time"]'::jsonb, '{"レキ","レッキ"}', '{}', 'N3', 5, 14, '6b74', 'Compound: footsteps (止) passing the granaries under the cliff, season after season — what one has passed through: history, career.', 'Your footprints past every harvest you''ve lived — レキ. 履歴書: the footprints, typed up.'),
  ('衛', '衛', '["defense","protection"]'::jsonb, '{"エイ","エ"}', '{}', 'N2', 5, 16, '885b', 'Phono-semantic: patrol routes (行) + 韋 ''circling feet'' (phonetic エイ) — sentries circling the walls: to guard.', 'Feet tracing the ramparts all night — エイ. 衛星: the satellite, patrolling the planet.'),
  ('益', '益', '["benefit","gain","profit","advantage"]'::jsonb, '{"エキ","ヤク"}', '{"ま.す"}', 'N2', 5, 10, '76ca', 'Compound ideograph: water brimming over the dish (皿) — overflow: gain, benefit (the origin of 溢).', 'The bowl running over — エキ. 利益: the overflow, booked as profit.'),
  ('往', '往', '["journey","travel","chase away","let go","going","before","formerly"]'::jsonb, '{"オウ"}', '{"い.く","いにしえ","さき.に","ゆ.く"}', 'N2', 5, 8, '5f80', 'Phono-semantic: step (彳) + 主 (phonetic オウ) — setting out: to go (as opposed to 復, returning).', 'Outbound leg of the round trip — オウ. 往復: there and back, ticketed together.'),
  ('幹', '幹', '["tree trunk","main part","talent","capability"]'::jsonb, '{"カン"}', '{"みき"}', 'N2', 5, 13, '5e79', 'Phono-semantic: a frame-pole phonetic (カン) — the load-bearing shaft: trunk, mainstay; the capable one (幹事).', 'The pole everything else hangs from — みき. 新幹線: the trunk line of the whole country.'),
  ('眼', '眼', '["eyeball"]'::jsonb, '{"ガン","ゲン"}', '{"まなこ","め"}', 'N2', 5, 11, '773c', 'Phono-semantic: eye (目) + 艮 (phonetic ガン) — the eye as organ: eyeball; the discerning eye (眼力).', '目''s clinical cousin — ガン. 眼科: where eyeballs file complaints; 眼鏡: their crutches.'),
  ('紀', '紀', '["chronicle","account","narrative","history","annals","geologic period"]'::jsonb, '{"キ"}', '{}', 'N2', 5, 9, '7d00', 'Phono-semantic: thread (糸) + 己 (phonetic キ) — events strung in order: chronicle, era.', 'History on a single thread — キ. 世紀: the thread cut in hundred-year lengths.'),
  ('義', '義', '["righteousness","justice","morality","honor","loyalty","meaning"]'::jsonb, '{"ギ"}', '{}', 'N2', 5, 13, '7fa9', 'Compound: the offering sheep (羊) over the self (我) — the self made presentable: duty, righteousness; by extension ''in-law'', ''artificial''.', 'The ego dressed in sacrificial wool — ギ. 正義 and 義理: justice, and its social installment plan.'),
  ('興', '興', '["entertain","revive","retrieve","interest","pleasure"]'::jsonb, '{"コウ","キョウ"}', '{"おこ.る","おこ.す"}', 'N2', 5, 16, '8208', 'Compound ideograph: hands on all sides lifting together — raising up: to flourish, revive; raised spirits: interest, fun.', 'Everyone lifts and the mood rises with it — キョウ, おこす. 興味: the mind lifting toward something.'),
  ('句', '句', '["phrase","clause","sentence","passage","paragraph","counter for haiku"]'::jsonb, '{"ク"}', '{}', 'N2', 5, 5, '53e5', 'Compound ideograph: speech (口) wrapped in a hook (勹) — a bounded unit of language: phrase, verse.', 'Words tied off in a parcel — ク. 俳句: seventeen syllables, triple-wrapped.'),
  ('潔', '潔', '["undefiled","pure","clean","righteous","gallant"]'::jsonb, '{"ケツ"}', '{"いさぎよ.い"}', 'N2', 5, 15, '6f54', 'Phono-semantic: water (氵) + 絜 (phonetic ケツ) — washed and bound clean: pure.', 'Scrubbed until even the knots gleam — いさぎよい. 清潔: hygiene as a virtue.'),
  ('護', '護', '["safeguard","protect"]'::jsonb, '{"ゴ"}', '{"まも.る"}', 'N2', 5, 20, '8b77', 'Phono-semantic: words (言) + 蒦 (phonetic ゴ) — speaking for and shielding: to protect.', 'Advocacy with its arms out — ゴ. 看護, 弁護: nurses and lawyers, same kanji shield.'),
  ('災', '災', '["disaster","calamity","woe","curse","evil"]'::jsonb, '{"サイ"}', '{"わざわ.い"}', 'N2', 5, 7, '707d', 'Compound ideograph: flood (巛) over fire (火) — the two classic ruins in one character: calamity.', 'Water above, fire below: pick your catastrophe — わざわい. 災害: the news ticker''s kanji.'),
  ('桜', '桜', '["cherry"]'::jsonb, '{"オウ","ヨウ"}', '{"さくら"}', 'N2', 5, 10, '685c', 'Phono-semantic (simplified from 櫻): tree (木) + a phonetic — the blossom tree of Japan: the cherry.', 'The tree the whole country picnics under — さくら. 桜前線: the pink weather front.'),
  ('酸', '酸', '["acid","bitterness","sour","tart"]'::jsonb, '{"サン"}', '{"す.い"}', 'N2', 5, 14, '9178', 'Phono-semantic: fermentation jar (酉) + 夋 (phonetic サン) — the brew gone sharp: sour, acid.', 'The jar that turned — サン. 酸素: oxygen, chemistry''s sour salt namesake.'),
  ('士', '士', '["gentleman","scholar","samurai","samurai radical (no. 33)"]'::jsonb, '{"シ"}', '{"さむらい"}', 'N2', 5, 3, '58eb', 'Pictograph: read as a small ceremonial axe or an upright figure — the man of service: warrior, scholar, licensed professional (弁護士).', 'Shoulders broader than the feet: the standing officer — シ. 武士 then, 消防士 now.'),
  ('飼', '飼', '["domesticate","raise","keep","feed"]'::jsonb, '{"シ"}', '{"か.う"}', 'N2', 5, 13, '98fc', 'Phono-semantic: food (飠) + 司 (phonetic シ) — feeding on schedule: to keep animals.', 'Whoever manages the food bowl rules the species — かう. 飼い主: the bowl administrator.'),
  ('舎', '舎', '["cottage","inn","hut","house","mansion"]'::jsonb, '{"シャ","セキ"}', '{"やど.る"}', 'N2', 5, 8, '820e', 'Pictograph: a simple roofed building — lodgings: quarters, a hut.', 'Plain roof, plain walls, beds inside — シャ. 田舎: cottage country; 駅舎: the station''s own hut.'),
  ('謝', '謝', '["apologize","thank","refuse"]'::jsonb, '{"シャ"}', '{"あやま.る"}', 'N2', 5, 17, '8b1d', 'Phono-semantic: words (言) + 射 (phonetic シャ) — words released like an arrow: to apologize, to thank, to decline.', 'The sentence you loose and can''t take back — あやまる. 感謝: the grateful arrow.'),
  ('序', '序', '["preface","beginning","order","precedence","occasion","chance","incidentally"]'::jsonb, '{"ジョ"}', '{"つい.で","ついで"}', 'N2', 5, 7, '5e8f', 'Phono-semantic: hall (广) + 予 (phonetic ジョ) — the anteroom before the main hall: preface, sequence.', 'The lobby of the book — ジョ. 順序: lobby, hallway, room — in order.'),
  ('証', '証', '["evidence","proof","certificate"]'::jsonb, '{"ショウ"}', '{"あかし"}', 'N2', 5, 12, '8a3c', 'Phono-semantic: words (言) + 正 (phonetic ショウ) — testimony that squares with fact: proof, certificate.', 'Words that survive cross-examination — ショウ. 学生証, 証拠: laminated and legal proof.'),
  ('織', '織', '["weave","fabric"]'::jsonb, '{"ショク","シキ"}', '{"お.る","お.り","おり","-おり","-お.り"}', 'N2', 5, 18, '7e54', 'Phono-semantic: thread (糸) + 戠 (phonetic ショク) — threads crossed on the loom: to weave.', 'Warp meets weft, cloth happens — おる. 組織: society on the same loom.'),
  ('素', '素', '["elementary","principle","naked","uncovered"]'::jsonb, '{"ソ","ス"}', '{"もと"}', 'N2', 5, 10, '7d20', 'Compound: raw undyed silk (糸) — the base state: plain, element, bare (素手).', 'Thread before the dye vat — ソ, ス. 素晴らしい: plainness, somehow, become splendid.'),
  ('属', '属', '["belong","genus","subordinate official","affiliated"]'::jsonb, '{"ゾク","ショク"}', '{"さかん","つく","やから"}', 'N2', 5, 12, '5c5e', 'Phono-semantic (simplified from 屬): attached under (尸) — fastened to: to belong, be attached.', 'Pinned to the organization chart — ゾク. 所属: your box on the diagram.'),
  ('態', '態', '["attitude","condition","figure","appearance","voice (of verbs)"]'::jsonb, '{"タイ"}', '{"わざ.と"}', 'N2', 5, 14, '614b', 'Phono-semantic: 能 (phonetic タイ) + heart (心) — the bearing the heart gives the body: condition, attitude.', 'What the bear-heart looks like from outside — タイ. 態度: posture with opinions.'),
  ('提', '提', '["propose","take along","carry in hand"]'::jsonb, '{"テイ","チョウ","ダイ"}', '{"さ.げる"}', 'N2', 5, 12, '63d0', 'Phono-semantic: hand (扌) + 是 (phonetic テイ) — held out in the hand: to present, propose.', 'Offered at arm''s length for inspection — テイ. 提案: the held-out idea.'),
  ('統', '統', '["overall","relationship","ruling","governing"]'::jsonb, '{"トウ"}', '{"す.べる"}', 'N2', 5, 12, '7d71', 'Phono-semantic: thread (糸) + 充 (phonetic トウ) — all threads gathered to one end: to unify, govern.', 'Every strand pulled through one ring — トウ. 伝統 and 大統領: the long thread and its holder.'),
  ('肥', '肥', '["fertilizer","get fat","fertile","manure","pamper"]'::jsonb, '{"ヒ"}', '{"こ.える","こえ","こ.やす","こ.やし","ふと.る"}', 'N2', 5, 8, '80a5', 'Compound: flesh (月) filled out — to fatten; what fattens the soil: fertilizer.', 'Rich flesh, rich earth — こえる. 肥料: the field''s dinner.'),
  ('弁', '弁', '["valve","petal","braid","speech","dialect","discrimination","dispose of","distinguish","conical cap"]'::jsonb, '{"ベン","ヘン"}', '{"かんむり","わきま.える","わ.ける","はなびら","あらそ.う"}', 'N2', 5, 5, '5f01', 'Simplification merging three old characters (辯 speech, 瓣 petal/valve, 辨 discriminate) — hence its odd jobs: speech, valve, lunchbox (弁当), dialect.', 'One kanji, many part-time jobs — ベン. 弁護士 argues; 弁当 feeds; 関西弁 talks back.'),
  ('墓', '墓', '["grave","tomb"]'::jsonb, '{"ボ"}', '{"はか"}', 'N2', 5, 13, '5893', 'Phono-semantic: 莫 ''sun lost in grass'' (phonetic ボ) + earth (土) — the plot where the sun goes down: a grave.', 'Earth, grass, and a name — はか. お墓参り: visiting the quiet address.'),
  ('脈', '脈', '["vein","pulse","hope"]'::jsonb, '{"ミャク"}', '{"すじ"}', 'N2', 5, 10, '8108', 'Compound: flesh (月) + branching water — the body''s rivers: veins, the pulse; mountain chains (山脈).', 'Rivers under the skin, drumming — ミャク. 脈がある: a pulse — and a chance.'),
  ('映', '映', '["reflect","reflection","projection"]'::jsonb, '{"エイ"}', '{"うつ.る","うつ.す","は.える","-ば.え"}', 'N4', 6, 9, '6620', 'Phono-semantic: sun (日) + 央 ''center'' (phonetic エイ) — light catching the center of a surface: to reflect; thrown on a screen: to project.', 'Sunlight striking dead center on the water: the world doubled — うつる. A 映画 is that trick industrialized: light, centered, forty feet tall.'),
  ('私', '私', '["private","I","me"]'::jsonb, '{"シ"}', '{"わたくし","わたし"}', 'N4', 6, 7, '79c1', 'Compound ideograph: grain (禾) + 厶 ''hooked toward oneself'' — grain raked into one''s own pile: private; and the politest word for the self: I.', 'An arm curling the harvest toward its own chest: mine — わたし. The public gets 公, you keep 私: 私立, private; 私, me.'),
  ('洗', '洗', '["wash","inquire into","probe"]'::jsonb, '{"セン"}', '{"あら.う"}', 'N4', 6, 9, '6d17', 'Phono-semantic: water (氵) + 先 (phonetic セン — whose old sense includes the foot going ahead) — the traveler washing feet first at the door: to wash.', 'Water over the feet before (先) stepping inside: the original welcome — あらう. 洗濯 extended the courtesy to your socks.'),
  ('異', '異', '["uncommon","different","queerness","strangeness","wonderful","curious","unusual"]'::jsonb, '{"イ"}', '{"こと","こと.なる","け"}', 'N3', 6, 11, '7570', 'Pictograph: a figure raising a mask over its head — a face not one''s own: strange, different.', 'Both hands lifting a second face — こと(なる). 異常: the mask where the face should be.'),
  ('胃', '胃', '["stomach","paunch","crop","craw"]'::jsonb, '{"イ"}', '{}', 'N3', 6, 9, '80c3', 'Compound ideograph: a pouch of grain (田) over flesh (月) — the body''s grain-sack: the stomach.', 'The rice bag installed in your torso — イ. 胃が痛い: the bag registering a complaint.'),
  ('域', '域', '["range","region","limits","stage","level"]'::jsonb, '{"イキ"}', '{}', 'N3', 6, 11, '57df', 'Phono-semantic: earth (土) + 或 ''territory under guard'' (phonetic イキ) — land within drawn lines: region, range.', 'Ground patrolled to its markers — イキ. 地域: your patch of the map.'),
  ('宇', '宇', '["eaves","roof","house","heaven"]'::jsonb, '{"ウ"}', '{}', 'N3', 6, 6, '5b87', 'Phono-semantic: roof (宀) + 于 (phonetic ウ) — the great roof overhead; scaled up, the roof of all things: space.', 'From your eaves to the universe is one zoom-out — ウ. 宇宙: the house all houses stand in.'),
  ('延', '延', '["prolong","stretching"]'::jsonb, '{"エン"}', '{"の.びる","の.べる","の.べ","の.ばす"}', 'N3', 6, 8, '5ef6', 'Compound: a stride (廴) with the foot dragging one stroke longer — the road stretched out: to extend, delay.', 'One more step added every time you think it ends — のびる. 延期: tomorrow''s version of today.'),
  ('灰', '灰', '["ashes","puckery juice","cremate"]'::jsonb, '{"カイ"}', '{"はい"}', 'N3', 6, 6, '7070', 'Compound ideograph: fire (火) you can take in hand (厂, originally a hand) — fire cooled to powder: ash.', 'Fire tame enough to touch — はい. 灰色: the color fire leaves behind.'),
  ('拡', '拡', '["broaden","extend","expand","enlarge"]'::jsonb, '{"カク","コウ"}', '{"ひろ.がる","ひろ.げる","ひろ.める"}', 'N3', 6, 8, '62e1', 'Phono-semantic: hand (扌) + 広 ''wide'' (phonetic カク) — pushing the edges outward: to expand.', 'Both palms pressing the walls apart — カク. 拡大: the pinch-zoom kanji.'),
  ('革', '革', '["leather","skin","reform","become serious"]'::jsonb, '{"カク"}', '{"かわ"}', 'N3', 6, 9, '9769', 'Pictograph: an animal hide stretched and scraped on a frame — leather; hide utterly transformed, hence: radical change.', 'Rawhide worked until it''s something new — かわ. 革命: society on the stretching-frame.'),
  ('割', '割', '["proportion","comparatively","divide","cut","separate","split"]'::jsonb, '{"カツ"}', '{"わ.る","わり","わ.り","わ.れる","さ.く"}', 'N3', 6, 12, '5272', 'Phono-semantic: 害 (phonetic カツ) + blade (刂) — cut apart: to split; the cut shares: proportion (一割 = 10%).', 'The knife settles who gets what — わる. 三割引: thirty percent cut off before you pay.'),
  ('巻', '巻', '["scroll","volume","book","part","roll up","wind up","tie","coil","counter for texts (or book scrolls)"]'::jsonb, '{"カン","ケン"}', '{"ま.く","まき","ま.き"}', 'N3', 6, 9, '5dfb', 'Compound: hands rolling something around itself (the curled 巳) — to roll up: a scroll, a volume.', 'Rolled tight from the tail inward — まく. 巻き寿司: the edible edition; 第一巻: volume one.'),
  ('干', '干', '["dry","parch","ebb","recede","interfere","intercede"]'::jsonb, '{"カン"}', '{"ほ.す","ほ.し-","-ぼ.し","ひ.る"}', 'N3', 6, 3, '5e72', 'Pictograph: a forked pole or drying rack — laundry and fish hung to dry: to dry; poking the pole in: to meddle.', 'The rack in every Japanese balcony — ほす. 干し物 dries on it; 梅干し survived it.'),
  ('看', '看', '["watch over","see"]'::jsonb, '{"カン"}', '{"み.る"}', 'N3', 6, 9, '770b', 'Compound ideograph: a hand (手) shading the eye (目) — peering with care: to watch over, to nurse.', 'Hand at the brow, scanning the ward — カン. 看護師: the shaded eye that never quite sleeps.'),
  ('簡', '簡', '["simplicity","brevity"]'::jsonb, '{"カン","ケン"}', '{"えら.ぶ","ふだ"}', 'N3', 6, 18, '7c21', 'Phono-semantic: bamboo (⺮) + 間 (phonetic カン) — the bamboo writing-slip: brief by necessity: simple, concise.', 'A message that fits one slat of bamboo — カン. 簡単: complexity that missed the boat.'),
  ('危', '危', '["dangerous","fear","uneasy"]'::jsonb, '{"キ"}', '{"あぶ.ない","あや.うい","あや.ぶむ"}', 'N3', 6, 6, '5371', 'Compound ideograph: one figure leaning over the cliff, another crouched beneath — peril above and below: dangerous.', 'Toes over the edge, someone cowering under the overhang — あぶない. 危険: the sign at the drop.'),
  ('机', '机', '["desk","table"]'::jsonb, '{"キ"}', '{"つくえ"}', 'N3', 6, 6, '673a', 'Phono-semantic: wood (木) + 几 ''low table'' (phonetic キ) — the wooden work table: a desk.', 'A tree flattened into the thing you study kanji on — つくえ. Full circle every evening.'),
  ('疑', '疑', '["doubt","distrust","be suspicious","question"]'::jsonb, '{"ギ"}', '{"うたが.う"}', 'N3', 6, 14, '7591', 'Compound: a figure stopped mid-step, looking both ways — unable to commit: to doubt, suspect.', 'Frozen at the fork, weighing everything twice — うたがう. 疑問: the fork, punctuated.'),
  ('吸', '吸', '["suck","imbibe","inhale","sip"]'::jsonb, '{"キュウ"}', '{"す.う"}', 'N3', 6, 6, '5438', 'Phono-semantic: mouth (口) + 及 ''reach'' (phonetic キュウ) — the mouth drawing in: to inhale, absorb.', 'The mouth reaches without moving — すう. 深呼吸: reaching all the way down.'),
  ('供', '供', '["submit","offer","present","serve (meal)","accompany"]'::jsonb, '{"キョウ","ク","クウ","グ"}', '{"そな.える","とも","-ども"}', 'N3', 6, 8, '4f9b', 'Phono-semantic: person (亻) + 共 ''together'' (phonetic キョウ) — presenting with both hands: to offer; the one who accompanies: attendant (子供).', 'Hands out, offering or tagging along — そなえる, とも. 子供: the small companions; お供え: the offering shelf.'),
  ('胸', '胸', '["bosom","breast","chest","heart","feelings"]'::jsonb, '{"キョウ"}', '{"むね","むな-"}', 'N3', 6, 10, '80f8', 'Phono-semantic: flesh (月) + 匈 (phonetic キョウ) — the body''s wrapped chamber: the chest.', 'The ribcage drawn as a parcel around its cargo — むね. 胸がいっぱい: the parcel over capacity.'),
  ('勤', '勤', '["diligence","become employed","serve"]'::jsonb, '{"キン","ゴン"}', '{"つと.める","-づと.め","つと.まる","いそ.しむ"}', 'N3', 6, 12, '52e4', 'Phono-semantic: 堇 (phonetic キン) + strength (力) — strength applied without letup: diligence; applied daily: employment.', 'Muscle showing up on schedule — つとめる. 通勤: diligence with a train pass.'),
  ('敬', '敬', '["awe","respect","honor","revere"]'::jsonb, '{"ケイ","キョウ"}', '{"うやま.う"}', 'N3', 6, 12, '656c', 'Compound: alertness (苟, a figure braced) + the correcting hand (攵) — bearing held straight before authority: respect, reverence.', 'Back straight, voice careful — うやまう. 敬語: the grammar of standing up straight.'),
  ('警', '警', '["admonish","commandment"]'::jsonb, '{"ケイ"}', '{"いまし.める"}', 'N3', 6, 19, '8b66', 'Phono-semantic: 敬 (phonetic ケイ) + words (言) — the warning spoken with authority: to admonish, guard against.', 'Respect, with a loudspeaker — ケイ. 警察: the warning, uniformed.'),
  ('劇', '劇', '["drama","play"]'::jsonb, '{"ゲキ"}', '{}', 'N3', 6, 15, '5287', 'Phono-semantic: 豦 ''tiger against boar'' (phonetic ゲキ) + blade (刂) — ferocious contest: intensity; staged intensity: drama.', 'Tiger versus boar with knives: opening night — ゲキ. 劇場: the cage with seats.'),
  ('券', '券', '["ticket"]'::jsonb, '{"ケン"}', '{}', 'N3', 6, 8, '5238', 'Compound: a contract tally cut in two with the blade (刀) — each party keeps a half: a certificate, a ticket.', 'The stub torn along the knife-line — ケン. 切符 and 券: proof you paid, in two pieces.'),
  ('権', '権', '["authority","power","rights"]'::jsonb, '{"ケン","ゴン"}', '{"おもり","かり","はか.る"}', 'N3', 6, 15, '6a29', 'Phono-semantic (simplified from 權): wood (木) + 雚 (phonetic ケン) — originally the steelyard''s weighing arm: the power to decide weights: authority, rights.', 'Whoever holds the scale-arm sets the price — ケン. 権利: your grip on the arm, in law.'),
  ('呼', '呼', '["call","call out to","invite"]'::jsonb, '{"コ"}', '{"よ.ぶ"}', 'N3', 6, 8, '547c', 'Phono-semantic: mouth (口) + 乎 (phonetic コ) — breath pushed out in a shout: to call, to summon; to exhale (呼吸).', 'The breath that leaves with a name on it — よぶ. 呼吸: the quiet version, out and in.'),
  ('誤', '誤', '["mistake","err","do wrong","mislead"]'::jsonb, '{"ゴ"}', '{"あやま.る","-あやま.る"}', 'N3', 6, 14, '8aa4', 'Phono-semantic: words (言) + 呉 (phonetic ゴ) — words gone crooked: error, mis-.', 'The sentence that left the mouth wrong — あやまる. 誤解: the wrongness, received and grown.'),
  ('紅', '紅', '["crimson","deep red"]'::jsonb, '{"コウ","ク"}', '{"べに","くれない","あか.い"}', 'N3', 6, 9, '7d05', 'Phono-semantic: thread (糸) + 工 (phonetic コウ) — silk worked into deep red dye: crimson.', 'The vat where thread learns to blush — べに. 紅葉: the mountains dyeing themselves each fall.'),
  ('降', '降', '["descend","precipitate","fall","surrender"]'::jsonb, '{"コウ","ゴ"}', '{"お.りる","お.ろす","ふ.る","ふ.り","くだ.る","くだ.す"}', 'N3', 6, 10, '964d', 'Compound ideograph: feet stepping down (夅) the mound (阝) — to descend; what descends from the sky: rain and snow (降る).', 'Down the slope one careful foot at a time — おりる; the sky doing it too — ふる. 降りる the bus, 降る the rain.'),
  ('刻', '刻', '["engrave","cut fine","chop","hash","mince","time","carving"]'::jsonb, '{"コク"}', '{"きざ.む","きざ.み"}', 'N3', 6, 8, '523b', 'Phono-semantic: 亥 (phonetic コク) + blade (刂) — cut deep and fine: to engrave; time notched in marks: a moment.', 'Each notch on the timekeeper''s board is one 刻 — きざむ. 遅刻: arriving after your notch.'),
  ('骨', '骨', '["skeleton","bone","remains","frame"]'::jsonb, '{"コツ"}', '{"ほね"}', 'N3', 6, 10, '9aa8', 'Compound ideograph: the joint socket (冎) with flesh (月) below — the frame under the meat: bone.', 'The scaffolding the body rents — ほね. 骨折: a scaffolding incident.'),
  ('困', '困', '["quandary","become distressed","annoyed"]'::jsonb, '{"コン"}', '{"こま.る"}', 'N3', 6, 7, '56f0', 'Compound ideograph: a tree (木) boxed in walls (囗) — growth with nowhere to go: hardship, being stuck.', 'The tree pressing against all four walls — こまる. 困った…: the sound a boxed tree makes.'),
  ('砂', '砂', '["sand"]'::jsonb, '{"サ","シャ"}', '{"すな"}', 'N3', 6, 9, '7802', 'Compound ideograph: stone (石) reduced to its least (少) — rock in crumbs: sand.', 'Boulders retired into a beach — すな. 砂糖 borrowed the texture for sugar.'),
  ('座', '座', '["squat","seat","cushion","gathering","sit"]'::jsonb, '{"ザ"}', '{"すわ.る"}', 'N3', 6, 10, '5ea7', 'Compound: two people (人人) settled on the ground (土) under a roof (广) — the sitting place: seat, gathering, constellation.', 'Everyone down on the floor of the hall — すわる. 銀座: ''the silver seat''; 星座: seats assigned to stars.'),
  ('済', '済', '["settle (debt, etc.)","relieve (burden)","finish","come to an end","excusable","need not"]'::jsonb, '{"サイ","セイ"}', '{"す.む","-ず.み","-ずみ","す.まない","す.ます","-す.ます","すく.う","な.す","わたし","わた.る"}', 'N3', 6, 11, '6e08', 'Phono-semantic (simplified from 濟): water (氵) + 斉 ''even'' (phonetic サイ) — crossing the water and coming out even: to settle, complete, relieve.', 'The debt crosses the river and lands squared — すむ. 経済 keeps society''s water level; 済みません: ''it never settles'' — hence the apology.'),
  ('冊', '冊', '["tome","counter for books","volume"]'::jsonb, '{"サツ","サク"}', '{"ふみ"}', 'N3', 6, 5, '518a', 'Pictograph: bamboo slips laced together with cord — the ancient book: a volume; the counter for books.', 'Slats and binding, drawn exactly — サツ. 一冊, 二冊: books counted by their spines'' ancestor.'),
  ('詞', '詞', '["part of speech","words","poetry"]'::jsonb, '{"シ"}', '{"ことば"}', 'N3', 6, 12, '8a5e', 'Phono-semantic: words (言) + 司 ''administer'' (phonetic シ) — words sorted by function: parts of speech; the words of a song: lyrics.', 'The grammar office files every word by job — シ. 歌詞: words filed under ''sing''.'),
  ('誌', '誌', '["document","records"]'::jsonb, '{"シ"}', '{}', 'N3', 6, 14, '8a8c', 'Phono-semantic: words (言) + 志 (phonetic シ) — things set down to be remembered: a record, a journal.', 'Writing that means to stick around — シ. 雑誌: the record, glossy and monthly.'),
  ('捨', '捨', '["discard","throw away","abandon","resign","reject","sacrifice"]'::jsonb, '{"シャ"}', '{"す.てる"}', 'N3', 6, 11, '6368', 'Phono-semantic: hand (扌) + 舎 (phonetic シャ) — the hand letting go: to throw away, abandon.', 'Open the fingers and walk back to the house — すてる. 捨てる before 拾う: the pair of opposite palms.'),
  ('若', '若', '["young","if","perhaps","possibly","low number","immature"]'::jsonb, '{"ジャク","ニャク","ニャ"}', '{"わか.い","わか-","も.しくわ","も.し","も.しくは","ごと.し"}', 'N3', 6, 8, '82e5', 'Pictograph: a young figure with arms raised through loose hair — supple youth; borrowed early for ''if, such as''.', 'Green shoots and easy joints — わかい. 若者: the shoots, plural and loud.'),
  ('収', '収', '["income","obtain","reap","pay","supply","store"]'::jsonb, '{"シュウ"}', '{"おさ.める","おさ.まる"}', 'N3', 6, 4, '53ce', 'Phono-semantic: 丩 (phonetic シュウ) + hand (又) — gathering in by hand: to collect, obtain; what comes in: income.', 'The hand reeling the line back in — おさめる. 収入: whatever the reel brings home.'),
  ('純', '純', '["genuine","purity","innocence","net (profit)"]'::jsonb, '{"ジュン"}', '{}', 'N3', 6, 10, '7d14', 'Phono-semantic: thread (糸) + 屯 (phonetic ジュン) — raw silk before any dye: unmixed, pure.', 'Thread the exact color it was born — ジュン. 純粋: nothing added, nothing hidden.'),
  ('処', '処', '["dispose","manage","deal with","sentence","condemn","act","behave","place"]'::jsonb, '{"ショ"}', '{"ところ","-こ","お.る"}', 'N3', 6, 5, '51e6', 'Compound (simplified from 處): feet come to rest at the table (几) — where one settles: a place; settling matters: to handle, dispose.', 'Sit down and deal with it — ショ. 処理: the desk where things stop circulating.'),
  ('署', '署', '["signature","govt office","police station"]'::jsonb, '{"ショ"}', '{}', 'N3', 6, 13, '7f72', 'Phono-semantic: net (罒) + 者 (phonetic ショ) — personnel assigned across the net of posts: a station, office; to sign one''s post: signature.', 'The duty roster''s grid with your name in a box — ショ. 警察署: the box with sirens; 署名: your box, inked.'),
  ('諸', '諸', '["various","many","several","together"]'::jsonb, '{"ショ"}', '{"もろ"}', 'N3', 6, 15, '8af8', 'Phono-semantic: words (言) + 者 (phonetic ショ) — all the ones spoken of: various, the several.', '''…and associated others'' — ショ. 諸国, 諸問題: the et-cetera made official.'),
  ('除', '除', '["exclude","division (x/3)","remove","abolish","cancel","except"]'::jsonb, '{"ジョ","ジ"}', '{"のぞ.く","-よ.け"}', 'N3', 6, 10, '9664', 'Phono-semantic: mound (阝) + 余 (phonetic ジョ) — clearing the path up the mound: to remove, exclude; division in math.', 'Shovel the extra off the steps — のぞく. 掃除: the daily exclusion of dust.'),
  ('将', '将', '["leader","commander","general","admiral","or","and again","soon","from now on","just about"]'::jsonb, '{"ショウ","ソウ"}', '{"まさ.に","はた","まさ","ひきい.る","もって"}', 'N3', 6, 10, '5c06', 'Phono-semantic: a phonetic (爿) + hand presenting meat — the one who presides at the offering: commander; who leads what comes next: ''about to''.', 'The general serves the first portion — ショウ. 将来: where the column is headed; 将棋: war on a board.'),
  ('承', '承', '["acquiesce","hear","listen to","be informed","receive"]'::jsonb, '{"ショウ","ジョウ"}', '{"うけたまわ.る","う.ける"}', 'N3', 6, 8, '627f', 'Pictograph: hands raised to catch what is handed down — to receive from above: to accept, to hear (humbly).', 'Both hands up, catching the decision — うけたまわる. 承知しました: caught, and holding.'),
  ('蒸', '蒸', '["steam","heat","sultry","foment","get musty"]'::jsonb, '{"ジョウ","セイ"}', '{"む.す","む.れる","む.らす"}', 'N3', 6, 13, '84b8', 'Phono-semantic: plants (艹) + 烝 ''rising vapor over fire'' (phonetic ジョウ) — heat rising through: to steam.', 'Greens in the basket, fire below, cloud above — むす. 蒸し暑い: the weather doing it to you.'),
  ('針', '針', '["needle","pin","staple","stinger"]'::jsonb, '{"シン"}', '{"はり"}', 'N3', 6, 10, '91dd', 'Compound: metal (金) + 十 — the original pictograph of the needle (十 was a needle before it was ''ten''): the metal needle, the hand of a clock.', '十 got its old job back, in steel — はり. 方針: the needle a policy follows.'),
  ('専', '専', '["specialty","exclusive","mainly","solely"]'::jsonb, '{"セン"}', '{"もっぱ.ら"}', 'N3', 6, 9, '5c02', 'Pictograph: a spindle turned by one hand (寸) — one axis, one motion: exclusive, specialized.', 'The wheel spins on exactly one thing — もっぱら. 専門: the spindle you chose for life.'),
  ('泉', '泉', '["spring","fountain"]'::jsonb, '{"セン"}', '{"いずみ"}', 'N3', 6, 9, '6cc9', 'Pictograph: water welling white from the rock — the spring, the source.', 'White water rising out of nowhere — いずみ. 温泉: the spring that runs hot.'),
  ('善', '善', '["virtuous","good","goodness"]'::jsonb, '{"ゼン"}', '{"よ.い","い.い","よ.く","よし.とする"}', 'N3', 6, 12, '5584', 'Compound: the sacrificial sheep (羊) over words of blessing — goodness spoken and offered: virtuous.', 'The gentle animal and the kind sentence, stacked — ゼン. 改善: goodness with a to-do list.'),
  ('層', '層', '["stratum","social class","layer","story","floor"]'::jsonb, '{"ソウ"}', '{}', 'N3', 6, 14, '5c64', 'Phono-semantic: structure (尸) + 曽 ''layers'' (phonetic ソウ) — floors stacked in a building, strata in rock or society.', 'Story on story, sediment with elevators — ソウ. 高層ビル: strata you can rent.'),
  ('操', '操', '["maneuver","manipulate","operate","steer","chastity","virginity","fidelity"]'::jsonb, '{"ソウ","サン"}', '{"みさお","あやつ.る"}', 'N3', 6, 16, '64cd', 'Phono-semantic: hand (扌) + 喿 (phonetic ソウ) — the hand in full command: to operate, handle; a grip that never slips: integrity.', 'Fingers on every lever at once — あやつる. 体操: operating your own body like machinery.'),
  ('窓', '窓', '["window","pane"]'::jsonb, '{"ソウ","ス"}', '{"まど","てんまど","けむだし"}', 'N3', 6, 11, '7a93', 'Phono-semantic: opening (穴) + a phonetic — the wall''s opening for light and air: window.', 'The hole the house breathes through, with your heart parked at it — まど. 窓side seats sell out first.'),
  ('装', '装', '["attire","dress","pretend","disguise","profess"]'::jsonb, '{"ソウ","ショウ"}', '{"よそお.う","よそお.い"}', 'N3', 6, 12, '88c5', 'Phono-semantic: 壮 (phonetic ソウ) + garment (衣) — dressed for the part: attire; fitted out: to equip, feign.', 'The costume that makes the role — ソウ. 服装 for people, 装置 for machines: everyone dressed to function.'),
  ('臓', '臓', '["entrails","viscera","bowels"]'::jsonb, '{"ゾウ"}', '{"はらわた"}', 'N3', 6, 19, '81d3', 'Phono-semantic: flesh (月) + 蔵 ''storehouse'' (phonetic ゾウ) — the body''s stored organs: viscera.', 'The torso''s warehouse shelves — ゾウ. 心臓: the one machine in the warehouse that never clocks out.'),
  ('蔵', '蔵', '["storehouse","hide","own","have","possess"]'::jsonb, '{"ゾウ","ソウ"}', '{"くら","おさ.める","かく.れる"}', 'N3', 6, 15, '8535', 'Phono-semantic: cover (艹) + 臧 (phonetic ゾウ) — goods hidden away under guard: storehouse, to conceal.', 'The thick-walled kura behind the shop — くら. 冷蔵庫: the kura that hums.'),
  ('存', '存', '["exist","suppose","be aware of","believe","feel"]'::jsonb, '{"ソン","ゾン"}', '{"ながら.える","あ.る","たも.つ","と.う"}', 'N3', 6, 6, '5b58', 'Compound: the sprout (才) with the child (子) — young life persisting: to exist, remain; held in mind: to know (ご存じ).', 'The seedling and the child both keep going — ソン. 存在: the stubbornness of being here.'),
  ('尊', '尊', '["revered","valuable","precious","noble","exalted"]'::jsonb, '{"ソン"}', '{"たっと.い","とうと.い","たっと.ぶ","とうと.ぶ"}', 'N3', 6, 12, '5c0a', 'Compound ideograph: hands (寸) lifting the ceremonial wine vessel (酋) — raised high: honored, revered.', 'The vessel lifted above eye level — とうとい. 尊敬: holding a person the same way.'),
  ('退', '退', '["retreat","withdraw","retire","resign","repel","expel","reject"]'::jsonb, '{"タイ"}', '{"しりぞ.く","しりぞ.ける","ひ.く","の.く","の.ける","ど.く"}', 'N3', 6, 9, '9000', 'Compound: movement (辶) + 艮 ''stopping'' — walking back from the line: to withdraw, retire.', 'Steps taken in reverse, dignity intact — しりぞく. 退院: retreating from the hospital, gladly.'),
  ('宅', '宅', '["home","house","residence","our house","my husband"]'::jsonb, '{"タク"}', '{}', 'N3', 6, 6, '5b85', 'Phono-semantic: roof (宀) + 乇 ''taking root'' (phonetic タク) — the roof one roots under: residence.', 'Where your roots reach the floorboards — タク. お宅: your rooted place; 宅配: parcels aimed at roots.'),
  ('担', '担', '["shouldering","carry","raise","bear"]'::jsonb, '{"タン"}', '{"かつ.ぐ","にな.う"}', 'N3', 6, 8, '62c5', 'Phono-semantic (simplified from 擔): hand (扌) + 旦 (phonetic タン) — hoisted onto the shoulder: to bear, take charge of.', 'Lift it at dawn, set it down at dusk — かつぐ. 担当: the load with your name on the manifest.'),
  ('探', '探', '["grope","search","look for"]'::jsonb, '{"タン"}', '{"さぐ.る","さが.す"}', 'N3', 6, 11, '63a2', 'Phono-semantic: hand (扌) + 罙 ''deep'' (phonetic タン) — the hand feeling into the dark: to probe, search.', 'Arm in the hole up to the elbow, hoping — さがす. 探偵: groping through other people''s dark.'),
  ('暖', '暖', '["warmth"]'::jsonb, '{"ダン","ノン"}', '{"あたた.か","あたた.かい","あたた.まる","あたた.める"}', 'N3', 6, 13, '6696', 'Phono-semantic: sun (日) + 爰 (phonetic ダン) — the sun lending a hand: warm (of air and rooms).', 'Sunlight passed down like a rope — あたたかい. 暖房: the rope, plugged in.'),
  ('段', '段', '["grade","steps","stairs"]'::jsonb, '{"ダン","タン"}', '{}', 'N3', 6, 9, '6bb5', 'Compound: notches hewn (殳) into the slope — steps cut in rock: stairs, grades, stages.', 'Chisel one step, then the next — ダン. 階段 climbs buildings; 段々 climbs anything, gradually.'),
  ('値', '値', '["price","cost","value"]'::jsonb, '{"チ"}', '{"ね","あたい"}', 'N3', 6, 10, '5024', 'Phono-semantic: person (亻) + 直 (phonetic チ) — what a thing squarely comes to: its value, price.', 'Looked at straight, it''s worth exactly this — ね, あたい. 値段: honesty in digits.'),
  ('宙', '宙', '["mid-air","air","space","sky","memorization","interval of time"]'::jsonb, '{"チュウ"}', '{}', 'N3', 6, 8, '5b99', 'Phono-semantic: roof (宀) + 由 (phonetic チュウ) — the vault overhead: mid-air; with 宇, all of space.', 'The ceiling with no beams: hang anything there — チュウ. 宇宙: the roofless roof.'),
  ('著', '著', '["renowned","publish","write","remarkable","phenomenal","put on","don","wear","arrival","finish (race)","counter for suits of clothing","literary work"]'::jsonb, '{"チョ","チャク"}', '{"あらわ.す","いちじる.しい"}', 'N3', 6, 11, '8457', 'Phono-semantic: 艹 + 者 (phonetic チョ) — set down visibly: to write, publish; visibly known: renowned.', 'The someone (者) whose name grew leaves — チョ. 著者: the name on the spine.'),
  ('庁', '庁', '["government office"]'::jsonb, '{"チョウ","テイ"}', '{"やくしょ"}', 'N3', 6, 5, '5e81', 'Phono-semantic (simplified from 廳): building (广) + 丁 (phonetic チョウ) — the hall where affairs are heard: agency, office.', 'The building with a number and no charm — チョウ. 県庁, 気象庁: bureaucracy''s roofline.'),
  ('頂', '頂', '["place on the head","receive","top of head","top","summit","peak"]'::jsonb, '{"チョウ"}', '{"いただ.く","いただき"}', 'N3', 6, 11, '9802', 'Phono-semantic: 丁 (phonetic チョウ) + head (頁) — the crown of the head: summit; receiving raised to one''s head: humbly accept (頂く).', 'Held above your head in thanks — いただく. 山頂: where the mountain does the same.'),
  ('賃', '賃', '["fare","fee","hire","rent","wages","charge"]'::jsonb, '{"チン"}', '{}', 'N3', 6, 13, '8cc3', 'Phono-semantic: 任 ''burden'' (phonetic チン) + money (貝) — payment for the burden borne: wages, fare, rent.', 'The load priced per shoulder-mile — チン. 家賃, 運賃: what carrying costs.'),
  ('痛', '痛', '["pain","hurt","damage","bruise"]'::jsonb, '{"ツウ"}', '{"いた.い","いた.む","いた.ましい","いた.める"}', 'N3', 6, 12, '75db', 'Phono-semantic: sickness (疒) + 甬 (phonetic ツウ) — the ache running through like a pipe: pain.', 'The hurt with its own plumbing — いたい. 頭痛, 腹痛: pain, routed by district.'),
  ('展', '展', '["unfold","expand"]'::jsonb, '{"テン"}', '{}', 'N3', 6, 10, '5c55', 'Compound: cloth spread wide under a roof (尸) — rolled things opened out: to unfold, display, develop.', 'The bolt of silk rolled across the whole floor — テン. 展覧会: unfolding, ticketed.'),
  ('党', '党', '["party","faction","clique"]'::jsonb, '{"トウ"}', '{"なかま","むら"}', 'N3', 6, 10, '515a', 'Phono-semantic (simplified from 黨): 尚 (phonetic トウ) + a base — those gathered under one banner: a faction, a political party.', 'Matching armbands, matching slogans, one roof — トウ. 政党: the faction with microphones.'),
  ('届', '届', '["deliver","reach","arrive","report","notify","forward"]'::jsonb, '{"カイ"}', '{"とど.ける","-とど.け","とど.く"}', 'N3', 6, 8, '5c4a', 'Compound: brought all the way in under the roof (尸) — to arrive at its destination: to deliver, to reach; the notification filed: 届け.', 'Not delivered until it''s through the door — とどく. 荷物が届いた: the kanji''s happy ending.'),
  ('難', '難', '["difficult","impossible","trouble","accident","defect"]'::jsonb, '{"ナン"}', '{"かた.い","-がた.い","むずか.しい","むづか.しい","むつか.しい","-にく.い"}', 'N3', 6, 18, '96e3', 'Phono-semantic: 堇 (phonetic ナン) + bird (隹) — the bird mired in clay: hardship, difficulty.', 'Wings caked in mud, still flapping — むずかしい. 難しい: every learner''s most-written kanji review.'),
  ('乳', '乳', '["milk","breasts"]'::jsonb, '{"ニュウ"}', '{"ちち","ち"}', 'N3', 6, 8, '4e73', 'Compound ideograph: a hand guiding a child (子) to the breast (乚) — nursing: milk.', 'The oldest meal service in the mammal business — ちち. 牛乳: the cow''s edition.'),
  ('認', '認', '["acknowledge","witness","discern","recognize","appreciate","believe"]'::jsonb, '{"ニン"}', '{"みと.める","したた.める"}', 'N3', 6, 14, '8a8d', 'Phono-semantic: words (言) + 忍 ''bear patiently'' (phonetic ニン) — examining until one accepts: to recognize, acknowledge.', 'Look long enough to say ''yes, it''s so'' — みとめる. 確認: saying it twice to be safe.'),
  ('脳', '脳', '["brain","memory"]'::jsonb, '{"ノウ","ドウ"}', '{"のうずる"}', 'N3', 6, 11, '8133', 'Phono-semantic: flesh (月) + a skull-and-hair phonetic — the organ in the skull: brain.', 'The body''s control room, drawn with its antenna hair — ノウ. 頭脳: hardware; 脳みそ: the affectionate name.'),
  ('拝', '拝', '["worship","adore","pray to"]'::jsonb, '{"ハイ"}', '{"おが.む","おろが.む"}', 'N3', 6, 8, '62dd', 'Compound: hands pressed together with the offering branch — the bow of reverence: to worship; humble prefix in letters (拝啓).', 'Palms together, forehead down — おがむ. 拝む: the shrine''s opening gesture.'),
  ('背', '背', '["stature","height","back","behind","disobey","defy","go back on","rebel"]'::jsonb, '{"ハイ"}', '{"せ","せい","そむ.く","そむ.ける"}', 'N3', 6, 9, '80cc', 'Compound: 北 ''backs turned'' + flesh (月) — the body''s back: the back; how tall it stands: stature; turning one''s back: to betray.', 'The side you can''t see of yourself — せ. 背が高い: measured up the back.'),
  ('晩', '晩', '["nightfall","night"]'::jsonb, '{"バン"}', '{}', 'N3', 6, 12, '6669', 'Phono-semantic: sun (日) + 免 ''escape'' (phonetic バン) — the sun slipping away: evening, night.', 'The sun makes its escape and dinner begins — バン. 今晩, 晩ご飯: the escape, celebrated nightly.'),
  ('否', '否', '["negate","no","noes","refuse","decline","deny"]'::jsonb, '{"ヒ"}', '{"いな","いや"}', 'N3', 6, 7, '5426', 'Compound ideograph: 不 ''not'' given a mouth (口) — the no spoken aloud: to negate, deny.', '不 finally says it out loud — いな. 否定: no, with grammar; 安否: the yes-or-no of safety.'),
  ('批', '批', '["criticism","strike"]'::jsonb, '{"ヒ"}', '{}', 'N3', 6, 7, '6279', 'Phono-semantic: hand (扌) + 比 ''compare'' (phonetic ヒ) — the hand weighing one against another: to critique, appraise.', 'Hold both up side by side and say which fails — ヒ. 批判: comparison with consequences.'),
  ('腹', '腹', '["abdomen","belly","stomach"]'::jsonb, '{"フク"}', '{"はら"}', 'N3', 6, 13, '8179', 'Phono-semantic: flesh (月) + 复 (phonetic フク) — the body''s round middle: belly; the seat of temper and resolve in Japanese idiom.', 'Where dinner returns (复) three times a day — はら. 腹が立つ: the belly standing up angry.'),
  ('並', '並', '["row","and","besides","as well as","line up","rank with","rival","equal"]'::jsonb, '{"ヘイ","ホウ"}', '{"な.み","なみ","なら.べる","なら.ぶ","なら.びに"}', 'N3', 6, 8, '4e26', 'Compound ideograph: two 立 ''standing'' figures side by side — abreast: to line up; ordinary as the middle of a row: regular.', 'Shoulder to shoulder in the queue — ならぶ. 並: also the menu''s ''regular size'', the row nobody photographs.'),
  ('閉', '閉', '["closed","shut"]'::jsonb, '{"ヘイ"}', '{"と.じる","と.ざす","し.める","し.まる","た.てる"}', 'N3', 6, 11, '9589', 'Compound ideograph: the gate (門) with its bar wedged in place — shut: to close.', 'The plank jammed across the doors — しめる. 閉店: the plank goes in at eight.'),
  ('片', '片', '["one-sided","leaf","sheet","right-side kata radical (no. 91)"]'::jsonb, '{"ヘン"}', '{"かた-","かた"}', 'N3', 6, 4, '7247', 'Pictograph: the right half of a split tree trunk (木 cut down the middle) — one side only: a piece, a fragment.', 'Half a log, forever missing its twin — かた. 片手: one hand; 片付ける: putting the halves away.'),
  ('補', '補', '["supplement","supply","make good","offset","compensate","assistant","learner"]'::jsonb, '{"ホ"}', '{"おぎな.う"}', 'N3', 6, 12, '88dc', 'Phono-semantic: garment (衤) + 甫 (phonetic ホ) — cloth patched where it wore thin: to mend, supplement.', 'Sew the missing square back in — おぎなう. 補習: patching the syllabus; 候補: patch material on standby.'),
  ('暮', '暮', '["evening","twilight","season''s end","livelihood","make a living","spend time"]'::jsonb, '{"ボ"}', '{"く.れる","く.らす"}', 'N3', 6, 14, '66ae', 'Compound: the sun sinking into the grasses (莫) with another 日 added when 莫 was borrowed away — day''s end: dusk; days strung together: to live, livelihood.', 'Sun down in the weeds, another day of living spent — くれる, くらす. 暮らし: the sum of your sunsets.'),
  ('宝', '宝', '["treasure","wealth","valuables"]'::jsonb, '{"ホウ"}', '{"たから"}', 'N3', 6, 8, '5b9d', 'Compound ideograph (simplified from 寶): jade (玉) kept under the roof (宀) — the household''s treasure.', 'The gem the house was built around — たから. 宝物: what you''d carry out of the fire first.'),
  ('訪', '訪', '["call on","visit","look up","offer sympathy"]'::jsonb, '{"ホウ"}', '{"おとず.れる","たず.ねる","と.う"}', 'N3', 6, 11, '8a2a', 'Phono-semantic: words (言) + 方 (phonetic ホウ) — going somewhere to speak with someone: to visit, inquire.', 'Words with a destination — おとずれる, たずねる. 訪問: the doorbell kanji.'),
  ('亡', '亡', '["deceased","the late","dying","perish"]'::jsonb, '{"ボウ","モウ"}', '{"な.い","な.き-","ほろ.びる","ほろ.ぶ","ほろ.ぼす"}', 'N3', 6, 3, '4ea1', 'Pictograph: a person hidden from sight — gone: to perish, be lost; the late.', 'Stepped behind the fold in the world — ない, ボウ. 亡くなる: the softest verb Japanese owns.'),
  ('忘', '忘', '["forget"]'::jsonb, '{"ボウ"}', '{"わす.れる"}', 'N3', 6, 7, '5fd8', 'Phono-semantic: 亡 ''gone'' (phonetic ボウ) + heart (心) — vanished from the heart: to forget.', 'The heart''s file marked 亡 — わすれる. 忘れ物: what your heart misplaced on the train.'),
  ('棒', '棒', '["rod","stick","cane","pole","club","line"]'::jsonb, '{"ボウ"}', '{}', 'N3', 6, 12, '68d2', 'Phono-semantic: wood (木) + 奉 (phonetic ボウ) — a straight length of wood: rod, pole.', 'Wood reduced to its simplest job — ボウ. 泥棒: the thief with the classic stick-over-shoulder.'),
  ('枚', '枚', '["sheet of...","counter for flat thin objects or sheets"]'::jsonb, '{"マイ","バイ"}', '{}', 'N3', 6, 8, '679a', 'Compound: wood (木) split by the hand (攵) into thin boards — flat pieces: the counter for sheets.', 'Planks shaved thin enough to count — マイ. 一枚, 二枚: paper, tickets, pizza — anything flat obeys.'),
  ('優', '優', '["tenderness","excel","surpass","actor","superiority","gentleness"]'::jsonb, '{"ユウ","ウ"}', '{"やさ.しい","すぐ.れる","まさ.る"}', 'N3', 6, 17, '512a', 'Phono-semantic: person (亻) + 憂 (phonetic ユウ) — a person of refined feeling: gentle; refined above others: excellent; an actor.', 'Grace under everything — やさしい, すぐれる. 優しい人 and 優勝: tenderness and first place, same kanji.'),
  ('郵', '郵', '["mail","stagecoach stop"]'::jsonb, '{"ユウ"}', '{}', 'N3', 6, 11, '90f5', 'Compound: relay posts strung out (垂) between towns (阝) — the courier stations: mail.', 'Town to town along the hanging line of post-stations — ユウ. 郵便局: the station that survived.'),
  ('預', '預', '["deposit","custody","leave with","entrust to"]'::jsonb, '{"ヨ"}', '{"あず.ける","あず.かる"}', 'N3', 6, 13, '9810', 'Phono-semantic: 予 (phonetic ヨ) + head (頁) — handed over ahead of need: to deposit, entrust.', 'Give it now, reclaim it later — あずける. 預金: your money, boarding at the bank.'),
  ('幼', '幼', '["infancy","childhood"]'::jsonb, '{"ヨウ"}', '{"おさな.い"}', 'N3', 6, 5, '5e7c', 'Compound ideograph: strength (力) still thread-thin (幺) — small and weak: infant, very young.', 'Muscle like sewing thread — おさない. 幼稚園: where the threads tangle happily.'),
  ('欲', '欲', '["longing","covetousness","greed","passion","desire","craving"]'::jsonb, '{"ヨク"}', '{"ほっ.する","ほ.しい"}', 'N3', 6, 11, '6b32', 'Phono-semantic: 谷 ''valley'' (phonetic ヨク) + 欠 ''gaping'' — an emptiness that gapes like a valley: desire, want.', 'A hunger with a canyon''s acoustics — ほしい. 欲しい: the valley asking politely.'),
  ('翌', '翌', '["the following","next"]'::jsonb, '{"ヨク"}', '{}', 'N3', 6, 11, '7fcc', 'Phono-semantic: wings (羽) + 立 (phonetic ヨク) — the day standing ready on the wing: the next, the following.', 'Tomorrow already perched and flexing — ヨク. 翌日: the day that takes off at midnight.'),
  ('乱', '乱', '["riot","war","disorder","disturb"]'::jsonb, '{"ラン","ロン"}', '{"みだ.れる","みだ.る","みだ.す","みだ","おさ.める","わた.る"}', 'N3', 6, 7, '4e71', 'Simplified from 亂: hands trying to untangle a snarled skein — chaos: disorder, riot.', 'A tongue wagging on a loose hinge — みだれる. 乱れる: hair, ranks, hearts — anything that had order.'),
  ('卵', '卵', '["egg","ovum","spawn","roe"]'::jsonb, '{"ラン"}', '{"たまご"}', 'N3', 6, 7, '5375', 'Pictograph: paired egg-sacs with the yolk-dots inside — eggs, roe.', 'Two eggs drawn mid-cluster, dots for yolks — たまご. 卵かけご飯: the pictograph, cracked over rice.'),
  ('裏', '裏', '["back","amidst","in","reverse","inside","palm","sole","rear","lining","wrong side"]'::jsonb, '{"リ"}', '{"うら"}', 'N3', 6, 13, '88cf', 'Phono-semantic: 里 (phonetic リ) tucked inside the split garment (衣) — the lining side: the back, the hidden side.', 'The village sewn into the coat''s lining — うら. 裏口: the door on the lining side of the house.'),
  ('律', '律', '["rhythm","law","regulation","gauge","control"]'::jsonb, '{"リツ","リチ","レツ"}', '{}', 'N3', 6, 9, '5f8b', 'Compound: the road (彳) ruled out by the brush (聿) — the written measure all steps must keep: law, meter, rhythm.', 'Rules written in bar lines — リツ. 法律 for citizens, リズム for drummers: same grid.'),
  ('論', '論', '["argument","discourse"]'::jsonb, '{"ロン"}', '{"あげつら.う"}', 'N3', 6, 15, '8ad6', 'Phono-semantic: words (言) + 侖 ''well-ordered'' (phonetic ロン) — words stacked in order: reasoned argument, discourse.', 'Claims shelved in strict sequence — ロン. 論文: the shelf, footnoted; 議論: two shelves colliding.'),
