  ('筋', '筋', '["muscle","sinew","tendon","fiber","plot","plan","descent"]'::jsonb, '{"キン"}', '{"すじ"}', 'N2', 6, 12, '7b4b', 'Compound: fibers like bamboo (⺮) in the flesh (月) with strength (力) — sinew, muscle; the fiber of an argument: the plot, the logic.', 'Bamboo-fiber cables under the skin — すじ. 筋肉 lifts; 筋が通る: the plot holds.'),
  ('系', '系', '["lineage","system"]'::jsonb, '{"ケイ"}', '{}', 'N2', 6, 7, '7cfb', 'Compound ideograph: a hand holding threads together — the connected line: lineage, system.', 'One thread pinched at the top, everything hangs from it — ケイ. 文系・理系: which thread you hang from at 18.'),
