  ('穴', '穴', '["hole","aperture","slit","cave","den"]'::jsonb, '{"ケツ"}', '{"あな"}', 'N2', 6, 5, '7a74', 'Pictograph: the mouth of a dwelling-cave — a hole; the radical of all excavations (空, 究, 窓).', 'The cave door our ancestors called home — あな. 穴場: the hole worth knowing about.'),
  ('憲', '憲', '["constitution","law"]'::jsonb, '{"ケン"}', '{}', 'N2', 6, 16, '61b2', 'Compound: the standard displayed under the roof, watched by eye and heart — the fundamental law: constitution.', 'The rules above even the rulers — ケン. 憲法: the roof over the law.'),
  ('絹', '絹', '["silk"]'::jsonb, '{"ケン"}', '{"きぬ"}', 'N2', 6, 13, '7d79', 'Phono-semantic: thread (糸) + 肙 (phonetic ケン) — the worm''s thread: silk.', 'The worm''s lifework, unwound — きぬ. 絹の道: the Silk Road, literally.'),
