  ('源', '源', '["source","origin"]'::jsonb, '{"ゲン"}', '{"みなもと"}', 'N2', 6, 13, '6e90', 'Phono-semantic: water (氵) + 原 ''spring at the cliff'' (phonetic ゲン) — 原 restored to its waters: the source.', '原 with the water switched back on — みなもと. 資源, 電源: sources you drill and sources you plug.'),
