  ('込', '込', '["crowded","mixture","in bulk","included","(kokuji)"]'::jsonb, '{}', '{"-こ.む","こ.む","こ.み","-こ.み","こ.める"}', 'N3', 8, 5, '8fbc', 'A kokuji — made in Japan: movement (辶) + enter (入) — pressing in: crowded; the ''into'' of compound verbs (申し込む, 詰め込む).', 'Everyone entering at once, nobody exiting — こむ. 申込み: pressing yourself into a form.'),
