  ('刺', '刺', '["thorn","pierce","stab","prick","sting","calling card"]'::jsonb, '{"シ"}', '{"さ.す","さ.さる","さ.し","さし","とげ"}', 'N3', 8, 8, '523a', 'Compound: a thorned branch (朿) + blade (刂) — the point that goes in: to stab, pierce; a calling card (名刺) ''stuck'' on arrival.', 'Thorn plus knife: pointed twice over — さす. 刺身: pierced fresh; 名刺: pierced into memory.'),
