  ('舟', '舟', '["boat","ship"]'::jsonb, '{"シュウ"}', '{"ふね","ふな-","-ぶね"}', 'N3', 8, 6, '821f', 'Pictograph: a small dugout boat seen from above, thwarts drawn in — a boat; the humble original of 船.', 'The rowboat before shipbuilding got ideas — ふね. 小舟: the pictograph, still afloat.'),
  ('柔', '柔', '["tender","weakness","gentleness","softness"]'::jsonb, '{"ジュウ","ニュウ"}', '{"やわ.らか","やわ.らかい","やわ","やわ.ら"}', 'N3', 8, 9, '67d4', 'Compound: wood (木) supple enough for a spear-shaft (矛) — bending without breaking: soft, gentle.', 'The sapling the spear is cut from: strength that bends — やわらかい. 柔道: winning by yielding.'),
