  ('召', '召', '["seduce","call","send for","wear","put on","ride in","buy","eat","drink","catch (cold)"]'::jsonb, '{"ショウ"}', '{"め.す"}', 'N3', 8, 5, '53ec', 'Phono-semantic: 刀 (phonetic ショウ) + mouth (口) — the call from above: to summon; in keigo, the honored doing of eating and wearing (召し上がる).', 'The order that arrives with authority behind it — めす. 召し上がれ: ''be summoned to eat'' — dinner, elevated.'),
  ('床', '床', '["bed","counter for beds","floor","padding","tatami"]'::jsonb, '{"ショウ"}', '{"とこ","ゆか"}', 'N3', 8, 7, '5e8a', 'Compound: wood (木) laid under the roof (广) — the raised planks one sleeps on: floor, bed.', 'Boards up off the dirt: civilization''s first mattress — ゆか, とこ. 床屋: the barber, from the shop''s raised floor.'),
  ('昇', '昇', '["rise up"]'::jsonb, '{"ショウ"}', '{"のぼ.る"}', 'N3', 8, 8, '6607', 'Phono-semantic: sun (日) + 升 (phonetic ショウ) — the sun climbing by measured degrees: to ascend, rise.', 'The sun taking the stairs — のぼる. 昇進: your own measured sunrise at work.'),
  ('紹', '紹', '["introduce","inherit","help"]'::jsonb, '{"ショウ"}', '{}', 'N3', 8, 11, '7d39', 'Phono-semantic: thread (糸) + 召 (phonetic ショウ) — tying one person''s thread to another''s: to introduce.', 'Two strangers, one knot — ショウ. 紹介: matchmaking at the thread level.'),
  ('畳', '畳', '["tatami mat","counter for tatami mats","fold","shut up","do away with"]'::jsonb, '{"ジョウ","チョウ"}', '{"たた.む","たたみ","かさ.なる"}', 'N3', 8, 12, '7573', 'Compound (simplified from 疊): mats folded and layered — the tatami; to fold up (畳む); rooms measured in mats.', 'The floor sold by the mat — たたみ. 六畳: six mats, one Tokyo apartment.'),
