  ('寝', '寝', '["lie down","sleep","rest","bed","remain unsold"]'::jsonb, '{"シン"}', '{"ね.る","ね.かす","い.ぬ","みたまや","や.める"}', 'N3', 8, 13, '5bdd', 'Compound: under the roof (宀), onto the bed-plank (爿) — laid down: to sleep.', 'Roof, bed, done — ねる. 寝坊: this kanji winning against your alarm.'),
  ('辛', '辛', '["spicy","bitter","hot","acrid"]'::jsonb, '{"シン"}', '{"から.い","つら.い","-づら.い","かのと"}', 'N3', 8, 7, '8f9b', 'Pictograph: the tattooing needle of punishment — sharp pain: bitter, harsh; on the tongue: spicy.', 'The needle on your tongue — からい; the needle in your week — つらい. Same kanji, two stings.'),
  ('震', '震', '["quake","shake","tremble","quiver","shiver"]'::jsonb, '{"シン"}', '{"ふる.う","ふる.える","ふる.わせる","ふる.わす"}', 'N3', 8, 15, '9707', 'Phono-semantic: rain/sky (雨) + 辰 (phonetic シン) — the sky''s tremor brought to earth: to quake, shake.', 'The storm that shakes from below instead — ふるえる. 地震: the kanji Japan checks its phone for.'),
  ('吹', '吹', '["blow","breathe","puff","emit","smoke"]'::jsonb, '{"スイ"}', '{"ふ.く"}', 'N3', 8, 7, '5439', 'Compound ideograph: mouth (口) + 欠 ''wide open'' — breath pushed out: to blow.', 'Cheeks full, candles doomed — ふく. 吹奏楽: blowing, organized into a band.'),
  ('姓', '姓', '["surname"]'::jsonb, '{"セイ","ショウ"}', '{}', 'N3', 8, 8, '59d3', 'Phono-semantic: woman (女) + 生 ''born'' (phonetic セイ) — the name of one''s birth-line (the oldest clans traced through mothers): surname.', 'The name you were born already carrying — セイ. 姓名: surname first, in Japan as in the kanji.'),
  ('占', '占', '["fortune-telling","divining","forecasting","occupy","hold","have","get","take"]'::jsonb, '{"セン"}', '{"し.める","うらな.う"}', 'N3', 8, 5, '5360', 'Compound ideograph: the diviner reading cracks (卜) and pronouncing (口) — to divine; to claim the spot the omen names: to occupy.', 'Read the crack, call the future, plant the flag — うらなう, しめる. 占い at the corner; 独占 in the boardroom.'),
