  ('袋', '袋', '["sack","bag","pouch"]'::jsonb, '{"タイ","ダイ"}', '{"ふくろ"}', 'N3', 8, 11, '888b', 'Phono-semantic: 代 (phonetic タイ) + garment (衣) — cloth sewn to carry: a bag, a sack.', 'Clothing for objects — ふくろ. 手袋: bags for hands — gloves, adorably.'),
