  ('恥', '恥', '["shame","dishonor"]'::jsonb, '{"チ"}', '{"は.じる","はじ","は.じらう","は.ずかしい"}', 'N3', 8, 10, '6065', 'Compound ideograph: ear (耳) + heart (心) — the heart heard in the burning ears: shame.', 'Ears red before the mind admits it — はずかしい. 恥ずかしい: biology outing you.'),
