  ('畜', '畜', '["livestock","domestic fowl and animals"]'::jsonb, '{"チク"}', '{}', 'N3', 8, 10, '755c', 'Compound: what the field (田) stores and raises (玄, accumulation) — animals kept: livestock.', 'The farm''s walking inventory — チク. 家畜: the animals with jobs.'),
