  ('殿', '殿', '["Mr.","hall","mansion","palace","temple","lord"]'::jsonb, '{"デン","テン"}', '{"との","-どの"}', 'N3', 8, 13, '6bbf', 'Compound: the great guarded hall — palace; the address written to its occupant: 〜殿.', 'The building with its own honorific — との, デン. 宮殿: the hall; 田中殿: the letterhead bow.'),
