  ('塔', '塔', '["pagoda","tower","steeple"]'::jsonb, '{"トウ"}', '{}', 'N3', 8, 12, '5854', 'Phono-semantic: earth (土) + 荅 (phonetic トウ) — coined to transcribe Sanskrit ''stupa'': the pagoda, any tower.', 'The word built to hold a borrowed building — トウ. 東京タワー''s ancestor: 五重塔.'),
