  ('到', '到', '["arrival","proceed","reach","attain","result in"]'::jsonb, '{"トウ"}', '{"いた.る"}', 'N3', 8, 8, '5230', 'Phono-semantic: 至 ''reach'' + 刂 (phonetic トウ) — getting all the way there: arrival.', 'The arrow hits the floor point-down: here — トウ. 到着: wheels touching tarmac.'),
  ('逃', '逃', '["escape","flee","shirk","evade","set free"]'::jsonb, '{"トウ"}', '{"に.げる","に.がす","のが.す","のが.れる"}', 'N3', 8, 9, '9003', 'Phono-semantic: movement (辶) + 兆 (phonetic トウ) — reading the omen and running: to flee.', 'See the cracks forming and go — にげる. 逃げる: wisdom, at speed.'),
