  ('曇', '曇', '["cloudy weather","cloud up"]'::jsonb, '{"ドン"}', '{"くも.る"}', 'N3', 8, 16, '66c7', 'Compound ideograph: sun (日) + cloud (雲) — the sun filed behind clouds: overcast.', 'Sun present but unavailable — くもり. The forecast''s middle child: 晴れ, 曇り, 雨.'),
  ('鈍', '鈍', '["dull","slow","foolish","blunt"]'::jsonb, '{"ドン"}', '{"にぶ.い","にぶ.る","にぶ-","なま.る","なまく.ら"}', 'N3', 8, 12, '920d', 'Phono-semantic: metal (金) + 屯 (phonetic ドン) — a blade gone soft: dull, slow.', 'The knife that squashes tomatoes — にぶい. 鈍行: the train equivalent, stopping everywhere.'),
