  ('被', '被', '["incur","cover","veil","brood over","shelter","wear","put on","be exposed (film)","receiving"]'::jsonb, '{"ヒ"}', '{"こうむ.る","おお.う","かぶ.る","かぶ.せる"}', 'N3', 8, 10, '88ab', 'Phono-semantic: garment (衤) + 皮 (phonetic ヒ) — thrown over one: to cover; what falls on one: to suffer, incur; grammar''s passive marker.', 'The blanket you didn''t ask for — こうむる. 被害: what landed on you; 被る: wearing it anyway.'),
