  ('封', '封', '["seal","closing"]'::jsonb, '{"フウ","ホウ"}', '{}', 'N3', 8, 9, '5c01', 'Compound: earth mounded (圭) by hand (寸) at the border — territory sealed off: to seal, enfeoff.', 'Press the mound of wax down firm — フウ. 封筒: the envelope, sealed by descent.'),
