  ('零', '零', '["zero","spill","overflow","nothing","cipher"]'::jsonb, '{"レイ"}', '{"ぜろ","こぼ.す","こぼ.れる"}', 'N3', 8, 13, '96f6', 'Phono-semantic: rain (雨) + 令 (phonetic レイ) — the last drops falling away to nothing: to dwindle: zero.', 'Rain ordered to stop: none left — レイ. 零点: the score with weather in its history.'),
  ('齢', '齢', '["age"]'::jsonb, '{"レイ"}', '{"よわい","とし"}', 'N3', 8, 17, '9f62', 'Phono-semantic: teeth (歯) + 令 (phonetic レイ) — age read from the teeth, as with horses: one''s years.', 'Count the teeth, name the years — レイ. 年齢: the dentist''s guess, made official.'),
  ('恋', '恋', '["romance","in love","yearn for","miss","darling"]'::jsonb, '{"レン"}', '{"こ.う","こい","こい.しい"}', 'N3', 8, 10, '604b', 'Simplified from 戀: a heart (心) caught in tangled threads — longing that binds: romantic love.', 'The heart, gift-wrapped in knots it tied itself — こい. 恋人: the person holding the other end.'),
  ('湾', '湾', '["gulf","bay","inlet"]'::jsonb, '{"ワン"}', '{"いりえ"}', 'N3', 8, 12, '6e7e', 'Phono-semantic: water (氵) + a ''bent bow'' phonetic (ワン) — the coast bent like a bow: a bay.', 'The shoreline drawn back like a bowstring — ワン. 東京湾: the bow aimed at the Pacific.'),
  ('腕', '腕', '["arm","ability","talent"]'::jsonb, '{"ワン"}', '{"うで"}', 'N3', 8, 12, '8155', 'Phono-semantic: flesh (月) + 宛 (phonetic ワン) — the bending limb: the arm; what arms learn: skill.', 'The limb that carries your craft — うで. 腕がいい: praise aimed at the arm, meant for the whole person.'),
  ('亜', '亜', '["Asia","rank next","come after","-ous"]'::jsonb, '{"ア"}', '{"つ.ぐ"}', 'N2', 8, 7, '4e9c', 'Pictograph: the cross-shaped plan of an ancient tomb chamber — borrowed for ''second-rank'' (亜熱帯) and to transcribe Asia (亜細亜).', 'The floor plan that named a continent — ア. 亜熱帯: one rank below tropical.'),
