  ('扱', '扱', '["handle","entertain","thresh","strip"]'::jsonb, '{"ソウ","キュウ"}', '{"あつか.い","あつか.う","あつか.る","こ.く"}', 'N2', 8, 6, '6271', 'Phono-semantic: hand (扌) + 及 (phonetic キュウ) — the hand dealing with what it reaches: to handle, treat.', 'Whatever lands in reach becomes your job — あつかう. 取り扱い注意: handle with this kanji.'),
