  ('慰', '慰', '["consolation","amusement","seduce","cheer","make sport of","comfort","console"]'::jsonb, '{"イ"}', '{"なぐさ.める","なぐさ.む"}', 'N2', 8, 15, '6170', 'Phono-semantic: 尉 ''press smooth'' (phonetic イ) + heart (心) — smoothing the heart: to console, comfort.', 'Ironing the wrinkles out of someone''s chest — なぐさめる. 慰める: the gentlest verb with a soldier inside.'),
