  ('鬱', '鬱', '["gloom","depression","melancholy","luxuriant"]'::jsonb, '{"ウツ"}', '{"うっ.する","ふさ.ぐ","しげ.る"}', 'N1', 8, 29, '9b31', 'Compound: vegetation choked dense — pent up: depression (憂鬱). Famously the hardest Jōyō kanji: 29 strokes.', 'The forest with no path out, drawn in full — ウツ. 鬱: even writing it is heavy.'),
  ('璧', '璧', '["sphere","ball"]'::jsonb, '{"ヘキ"}', '{"たま"}', 'N1', 8, 18, '74a7', 'Phono-semantic: 辟 (phonetic ヘキ) + jade (玉) — the flawless ritual disc: perfection — 完璧.', 'The jade with zero excuses — ヘキ. 完璧: note the 玉, not 土 — perfection is a jewel, not dirt.'),
  ('瘍', '瘍', '["swelling","boil","tumor"]'::jsonb, '{"ヨウ"}', '{"かさ"}', 'N1', 8, 14, '760d', 'Phono-semantic: 疒 + 昜 (phonetic ヨウ) — the festering swelling: ulcer (潰瘍).', 'The stomach''s protest note — ヨウ. 胃潰瘍: stress, published internally.'),
  ('箋', '箋', '["paper","label","letter","composition"]'::jsonb, '{"セン"}', '{"ふだ"}', 'N1', 8, 14, '7b8b', 'Phono-semantic: bamboo (⺮) + 戔 (phonetic セン) — the note slip: label — 付箋, the sticky note; 処方箋, the prescription.', 'The small paper with big authority — セン. 処方箋: the pharmacy''s password.'),
  ('籠', '籠', '["basket","devote oneself","seclude oneself","cage","coop","implied"]'::jsonb, '{"ロウ","ル"}', '{"かご","こ.める","こも.る","こ.む"}', 'N1', 8, 22, '7c60', 'Phono-semantic: bamboo (⺮) + 龍 (phonetic ロウ) — the woven cage: basket; shut inside: to seclude (籠る).', 'A basket strong enough to hold a dragon — かご. 引き籠り: the self-woven basket.'),
  ('緻', '緻', '["fine (i.e. not coarse)"]'::jsonb, '{"チ"}', '{"こまか.い"}', 'N1', 8, 16, '7dfb', 'Phono-semantic: thread (糸) + 致 (phonetic チ) — woven to the last strand: precise — 緻密.', 'Detail down to the thread count — チ. 緻密: the engineer''s compliment.'),
  ('羞', '羞', '["feel ashamed"]'::jsonb, '{"シュウ"}', '{"はじ.る","すすめ.る","は.ずかしい"}', 'N1', 8, 11, '7f9e', 'Compound: the offering presented — and the flush of presenting oneself: shame — 羞恥心.', 'The blush at being served up — シュウ. 羞恥心: the shyness organ.'),
  ('訃', '訃', '["obituary"]'::jsonb, '{"フ"}', '{"しらせ"}', 'N1', 8, 9, '8a03', 'Phono-semantic: words (言) + 卜 (phonetic フ) — the death notice: obituary (訃報).', 'The news no one wants to deliver — フ. 訃報: the black-bordered word.'),
  ('諧', '諧', '["harmony"]'::jsonb, '{"カイ"}', '{"かな.う","やわ.らぐ"}', 'N1', 8, 16, '8ae7', 'Phono-semantic: words (言) + 皆 (phonetic カイ) — voices agreeing: harmony — 俳諧, the haikai verse.', 'Everyone''s words in tune — カイ. 俳諧: Bashō''s genre.'),
  ('貪', '貪', '["covet","indulge in"]'::jsonb, '{"タン","ドン","トン"}', '{"むさぼ.る"}', 'N1', 8, 11, '8caa', 'Compound: treasure (貝) wanted now (今) — greed: to covet (貪欲).', '''Mine, immediately'' — むさぼる. 貪欲: hunger with a portfolio — also a compliment in sports.'),
  ('踪', '踪', '["remains","clue","footprint"]'::jsonb, '{"ソウ","ショウ"}', '{"あと"}', 'N1', 8, 15, '8e2a', 'Phono-semantic: foot (足) + 宗 (phonetic ソウ) — the trail of steps: whereabouts — 失踪, vanishing.', 'Footprints that stop mid-page — ソウ. 失踪: the missing-person file.'),
  ('辣', '辣', '["pungent","spicy","harsh","cruel","severe"]'::jsonb, '{"ラツ"}', '{"から.い"}', 'N1', 8, 14, '8fa3', 'Phono-semantic: 辛 ''spicy'' + 束 (phonetic ラツ) — heat concentrated: pungent — 辛辣, scathing.', 'Spice at critique strength — ラツ. 辛辣: reviews that leave marks; 辣油: the oil version.'),
  ('錮', '錮', '["confinement","to tie"]'::jsonb, '{"コ"}', '{"ふさ.ぐ"}', 'N1', 8, 16, '932e', 'Phono-semantic: metal (金) + 固 (phonetic コ) — sealed in metal: confinement — 禁錮, imprisonment.', 'The cell door''s alloy — コ. 禁錮: the sentence in years.'),
  ('塡', '塡', '["fill in","fill up","make good"]'::jsonb, '{"テン","チン"}', '{"はま.る","うず.める","は.める","ふさ.ぐ"}', 'N1', 8, 13, '5861', 'Phono-semantic: earth (土) + 眞 (phonetic テン) — packed full: to fill — 補塡, covering a shortfall.', 'The hole made whole — テン. 補塡: accounting''s spackle.'),
  ('頰', '頰', '["cheeks","jaw"]'::jsonb, '{"キョウ"}', '{"ほお","ほほ"}', 'N1', 8, 16, '9830', 'Phono-semantic: 夾 (phonetic キョウ) + head (頁) — the face''s sides: cheeks.', 'Where the face stores its blush — ほお. 頰張る: cheeks at capacity.'),
  ('𠮟', '𠮟', '["scold","reprove"]'::jsonb, '{"シツ","シチ","カ"}', '{"しか.る"}', 'N1', 8, 5, '20b9f', 'Phono-semantic: mouth (口) + 七 (phonetic シツ) — the sharp rebuke: to scold (𠮟る) — the Jōyō form of 叱.', 'Seven words, all pointed — しかる. 𠮟る: firm, brief, over.'),
  ('剝', '剝', '["come off","peel","fade","discolor"]'::jsonb, '{"ハク","ホク"}', '{"へ.ぐ","へず.る","む.く","む.ける","は.がれる","は.ぐ","は.げる","は.がす"}', 'N1', 8, 10, '525d', 'Phono-semantic: 彔 (phonetic ハク) + blade (刂) — stripped away: to peel — 剝がす.', 'The sticker''s slow surrender — はがす. 剝離: coming apart in layers.')
